  <para style="h">2 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu ca kabiri ca Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Sa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu ca kabiri ca</para>
  <para style="mt1">Samweli</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi abwirwa ko Sawuli yapfuye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Sawuli amaze gupfa, Dawidi aragaruka avuye kunesha Abamaleki aca aguma i Zikulagi imisi ibiri. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />Ku musi ugira gatatu umuntu umwe araza avuye mu ngabo za Sawuli, yitabaguriyeko impuzu yisuriyeko ivu mu mutwe. Ashitse aho Dawidi ari, aramwunamira ashitsa umutwe hasi mu kumuha icubahiro.<verse eid="2SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Dawidi aramubaza ati: “Uvuye he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:3">Aramwishura ati: “Ncitse kw’icumu mva aho Abisirayeli bari bacumbitse.”<verse eid="2SA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />Dawidi aramubaza ati: “Vyagenze gute? Mbarira.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:4">Aramwishura ati: “Ingabo z’Abisirayeli zahunze ku rugamba. Benshi bapfuye. Na Sawuli n’umuhungu wiwe Yonatani bapfuye.”<verse eid="2SA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Maze Dawidi abwira wa musore amuzaniye inkuru ati: “Ni igiki cakumenyesheje ko Sawuli n’umuhungu wiwe Yonatani bapfuye?”<verse eid="2SA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Wa musore ati: “Nari ku musozi Gilibowa, maze mbona Sawuli yishimikije icumu ryiwe, kandi azigirijwe n’imikogote n’abagendera ku mafarasi. <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Ahindukiye arambona, arampamagara, nanje ndamwishura nti: ‘Nogukorera iki?’<verse eid="2SA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />Arambaza ati: ‘Uri nde?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:8">Ndamwishura nti: ‘Ndi Umwamaleki.’<verse eid="2SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />Arambwira ati: ‘Egera hano unyice! Nta co ngisigaje, naho nkiri muzima.’<verse eid="2SA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />Nuko ndamwegera ndamuhohosha, kuko nabonye ko atari gukira. Maze nca mfata urugori rwari ku mutwe wiwe n’ikidede cari ku kuboko kwiwe nca ndabizanira databuja hano.”<verse eid="2SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Nuko Dawidi n’abo bari kumwe bitaburirako impuzu. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Bararira baraboroga barisonzesha gushika ku mugoroba ku bwa Sawuli n’umuhungu wiwe Yonatani, n’ingabo zose z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’ab’inzu ya Isirayeli bose, kuko bishwe n’inkota.<verse eid="2SA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Dawidi abwira wa musore yamuzaniye inkuru ati: “Uturuka he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:13">Arishura ati: “Ndi umuhungu w’inyambukira, Umwamaleki.”<verse eid="2SA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />Dawidi aramubaza ati: “Ni kuki watinyutse kwica uwo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarobanuje amavuta?”<verse eid="2SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Maze Dawidi ahamagara umwe mu bantu biwe ati: “Genda umwice!” Nuko aragenda aramwica. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Kuko Dawidi yari yamubwiye ati: “Amaraso yawe aje ku gatwe kawe. Akanwa kawe ni ko kakwagirije igihe wivugira uti: ‘Nishe uwo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarobanuje amavuta.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawidi acura intimba ku bwa Sawuli na Yonatani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Nuko Dawidi acura intimba ku bwa Sawuli n’umuhungu wiwe Yonatani, <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />aca ategeka abantu b’i Buyuda ngo bigishwe iyo ndirimbo yo gucura intimba y’umuheto (kandi yanditse mu gitabu ca Yashari). Aravuga ati:<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />“Iteka n’umunezero vyawe, yewe Isirayeli, birambaraye ku misozi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:19">Ese ukungene abahizi bawe bapfuye!<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />Ntimubibwire ab’i Gati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">ntimuvyamamaze mu mabarabara y’i Ashikeloni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">kugira ngo abakobwa b’Abafilisitiya ntibanezerwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">kugira ngo abakobwa b’izo ntakebwa ntibahimbarwe.<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />Yemwe misozi y’i Gilibowa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">ntimukongere kugira urume canke imvura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">canke ngo mugire imirima ishobora kwera ingano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">Kuko kuri mwebwe ari ho inkinzo z’abahizi zahumaniye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">Inkinzo ya Sawuli ntizosubira gusigwa amavuta.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />Amaraso adasesetse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">abahizi batarashwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:22">umuheto wa Yonatani ntiwigera usubira inyuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">kandi n’inkota ya Sawuli ntiyagaruka idakoze igikorwa cayo.<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />Sawuli na Yonatani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">bakiriho barakundwa cane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">kandi no mu rupfu ntibatandukanye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">Banyaruka kurusha inkona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">bari bakomeye kurusha intambwe.<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />Yemwe bakobwa ba Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">nimuririre Sawuli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:24">yabambika impuzu nziza z’igiciro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">yashariza impuzu zanyu n’ibisharizo vy’inzahabu.<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />Ese ukuntu abahizi baguye mu ntambara!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:25">Yonatani umuvyimba wiwe urambaraye ku misozi.<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />Ndababaye ku bwawe, Yonatani muvukanyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">wari uw’igiciro kuri jewe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">Urukundo wankunda rwari igitangaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">rwari igitangaza kurusha urw’abagore.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />Ewe kuntu abahizi baguye ku rugamba!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:27">Ibigwanisho vy’intambara vyasambuwe!”<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi aba umwami w’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Inyuma y’ivyo, Dawidi asiguza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Amubaza ati: “Nduge nje mu gisagara kimwe c’i Buyuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwishura ati: “Duga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Dawidi arabaza ati: “Nduze noshikira mu gisagara ikihe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwishura ati: “Heburoni.”<verse eid="2SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Nuko Dawidi araduga ajana n’abagore biwe babiri, Ahinowamu w’i Yezireyeli na Abigayili, umupfakazi wa Nabali w’i Karumeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />Dawidi ajana kandi na ba bantu bari kumwe na we bose, umwe wese n’umuryango wiwe, baja kuba i Heburoni no mu bisagara vyaho. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />Maze abantu b’i Buyuda baza i Heburoni baca barobanuza amavuta Dawidi ngo abe umwami w’umuryango wa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Maze Dawidi bamubwiye ko abantu b’i Yabeshi Gileyadi ari bo bahamvye Sawuli, <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />arungika intumwa ku bantu b’i Yabeshi Gileyadi zibabwira ziti: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abahezagire kuko mwerekanye urukundo mwakunda Sawuli shobuja mu kumuhambana iteka. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abagirire neza abereke n’ubwizigirwa bwiwe, kandi nanje nyene ni ko nzobagirira kuko mwakoze mutyo. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Ubu rero, mukomere mube abagabo, kuko Sawuli shobuja yapfuye, ariko kandi ab’inzu ya Yuda bamaze kunyimikisha amavuta kugira ngo mbe umwami wabo.”<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intambara yabaye hagati y’inzu ya Dawidi n’inzu ya Sawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Bikiri gutyo, Abuneri mwene Neri, umukuru w’ingabo za Sawuli, yari yafashe Ishibosheti mwene Sawuli amutwara i Mahanayimu. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Ashitseyo, amugira umwami w’intara za Gileyadi, Ashuri, Yezireyeli, Efurayimu, Benyamini na Isirayeli yose.<verse eid="2SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Ishibosheti mwene Sawuli yari amaze imyaka mirongo ine igihe yaba umwami w’Abisirayeli, atwara imyaka ibiri. Ariko, umuryango wa Yuda wowo, uguma uyoboka Dawidi. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Imyaka yose Dawidi yamaze ari umwami i Heburoni aganza inzu ya Yuda yabaye indwi n’amezi atandatu.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Abuneri mwene Neri, hamwe n’ingabo za Ishibosheti mwene Sawuli, bava i Mahanayimu baja i Gibeyoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Yowabu mwene Zeruwiya n’ingabo za Dawidi na bo baragenda baja guhura na bo, bahurira ku kidengeri c’i Gibeyoni. Ingabo zimwe zija ku ruhande rumwe rw’ico kidengeri izindi zija ku rundi ruhande.<verse eid="2SA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Maze Abuneri abwira Yowabu ati: “Reka dutore imisore ihaguruke igwane imbere yacu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:14">Yowabu aravuga ati: “Egome, tubigire uko.”<verse eid="2SA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Nuko bava hasi barabaharura, abagabo cumi na babiri baserukira Ababenyamini na Ishibosheti mwene Sawuli, hamwe n’abandi icumi na babiri ku ruhande rw’abaserukira Dawidi. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Maze umuntu wese aca asumira umutwe w’uwo ku rundi ruhande amuzibura inkota mu rubavu, bose bagwa hasi aho nyene bapfira rimwe. Baca bita aho hantu Helukati Hazurimu h’i Gibeyoni.<verse eid="2SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Kuva uwo musi haca haba intambara ikomeye, Abuneri n’Abisirayeli baratsindwa cane n’ingabo za Dawidi.<verse eid="2SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Abahungu batatu ba Zeruwiya: Yowabu, Abishayi na Asaheli ni ho bari. Uwo Asaheli mu kwiruka yaranyaruka cane kurya kw’ingeregere. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />Yiruka kuri Abuneri, kandi yanka kumuva inyuma ngo aje i buryo canke i bumoso. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Abuneri akebutse inyuma aramubaza ati: “Ni wewe ga Asaheli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:20">Arishura ati: “Ni jewe.”<verse eid="2SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Nuko Abuneri aramubwira ati: “Hindukirira i buryo canke i bumoso; maze ufate umwe muri barya basore umushikure ibigwanisho vyiwe.” Ariko Asaheli ntiyahagarika kumukurikira.<verse eid="2SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Abuneri yongera kubwira Asaheli ati: “Reka kwiruka unkurikira, ntibitume ndakwica. Noheza ngashobora nte gusubira kuraba mu maso ha mukuru wawe Yowabu?”<verse eid="2SA 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Ariko Asaheli aranka aguma amukurikira; nuko Abuneri amucumita icumu mu nda riseruka mu mugongo. Aca agwa ngaho arapfa. Umuntu wese yashika aho Asaheli yaguye yaca ahagarara.<verse eid="2SA 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Nuko Yowabu na Abishayi bakurikira Abuneri, izuba rirenga bashitse ku musozi wa Ama, hafi y’i Giya mu nzira ija mu bugaragwa bw’i Gibeyoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Maze abo mu ngabo za Abuneri bo mu muryango wa Benyamini bifatanya na Abuneri. Bigira akagwi bahagarara ku gatwe k’umusozi.<verse eid="2SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Abuneri ahamagara Yowabu ati: “Mbega tuzokwama tuzibagurana inkota igihe cose? Ntubona ko ibi bizotuzanira kwamana inzigo? Urindiriye iki kubuza abantu bawe gukurikira abavukanyi babo?”<verse eid="2SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Yowabu aramwishura ati: “Ndahiye uguhoraho kw’Imana, iyo utagira ico uvuga, twari gushishikara kubakurikira mbere n’ijoro ryose.”<verse eid="2SA 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Maze Yowabu avuza inzamba, abantu bose barahagarara; ntibasubira gukurikira Abisirayeli, canke ngo basubire kugwana.<verse eid="2SA 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Abuneri n’abantu biwe bagenda ijoro ryose baca mu kiyaya Araba. Bajabuka Yorodani, babandanya no mu gitondo cose maze bashika i Mahanayimu.<verse eid="2SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Nuko Yowabu asubira inyuma areka gukurikirana Abuneri aca akoranya abantu bose ngo arabe abo yabuze. Asanga mu bantu ba Dawidi habuze cumi n’icenda adashizemwo Asaheli. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Ariko abantu ba Dawidi bari bishe Ababenyamini amajana atatu na mirongo itandatu bari kumwe na Abuneri. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Batwara Asaheli bamuhamba mu mva ya se yari i Betelehemu. Hanyuma Yowabu n’ingabo ziwe bagenda ijoro ryose bashika i Heburoni umutwenzi utambitse.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Iyo yari intango y’intambara yamaze igihe kirekire hagati y’abashigikiye ingoma ya Dawidi, n’abakomeje gushigikira ingoma ya Sawuli. Mu bihe vyakurikiye, Dawidi yakomeje kuguma akomera, ariko abo mu muryango wa Sawuli bobo baguma baba abanyantegenke.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Aba ni bo bahungu Dawidi yavyariye i Heburoni:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 3:2">imfura yiwe ni Amunoni, nyina yari Ahinowamu w’i Yezireyeli;<verse eid="2SA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />uwa kabiri ni Kileyabu, nyina yari Abigayili umupfakazi wa Nabali w’i Karumeli;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 3:3">uwa gatatu ni Abusalomu, nyina yari Mayaka umukobwa wa Talumayi umwami w’i Geshuri;<verse eid="2SA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />uwa kane ni Adoniya, nyina yari Hagiti;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2SA 3:4">uwa gatanu ni Shefatiya, nyina yari Abitali;<verse eid="2SA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />n’uwa gatandatu, Itureyamu, uwo yavyaranye n’umugore wiwe Egula.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 3:5" />
  <para style="lf" vid="2SA 3:5">Abo ni bo Dawidi yavyariye i Heburoni.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abuneri ava kuri Ishibosheti yifatanya na Dawidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Muri ico gihe c’intambara hagati y’abagishigikiye ingoma ya Sawuli n’abashigikiye ingoma ya Dawidi, Abuneri agira ububasha bukomeye mu bari ku ruhande rwa Sawuli. <verse eid="2SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Sawuli yari afise incoreke yitwa Rizipa. Umusi umwe Ishibosheti yagiriza Abuneri, amubwira ati: “Ni kuki wubahuka kuryamana na Rizipa incoreke ya data, umukobwa wa Ayiya?”<verse eid="2SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Abuneri aca ashavuzwa cane n’uko Ishibosheti amwagirije, maze amwishura ati: “Mbega jewe ndi umutwe w’imbwa utembagaza uko wishakiye ku ruhande rw’Abayuda? Gushika uwu musi nabaye umwizigirwa mu nzu ya so Sawuli no mu muryango wiwe n’abagenzi biwe. Sinagutanze mu maboko ya Dawidi. Ariko uwu musi unyagirije icaha hamwe n’uwu mugore! <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" />Imana ize ibimpore, kandi birushirije, nintashitsa kuri Dawidi ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yamusezeraniye, <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />ngiye gukura ingoma mu nzu ya Sawuli ndayihe Dawidi aganze Abisirayeli n’Abayuda kuva i Dani gushika i Berisheba.” <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Ishibosheti ntiyubahutse kugira irindi jambo abwira Abuneri, kuko yamutinya.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Maze Abuneri atuma intumwa kuri Dawidi ati: “Mbega igihugu cose si rwawe? Emera tugiriranire isezerano, hanyuma nce ndagufasha kwigarurira Isirayeli yose.”<verse eid="2SA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />Dawidi aravuga ati: “Ni vyiza. Ndemeye kugiriranira isezerano nawe. Mugabo, ntuze wigere uza ngo tubonane amaso mu yandi utanzaniye Mikali umukobwa wa Sawuli.” <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" />Maze Dawidi atuma intumwa kuri Ishibosheti mwene Sawuli ati: “Mpa umugore wanje Mikali, uwo nakoye udukoba ijana tuvuye ku bitsinagabo vy’Abafilisitiya.”<verse eid="2SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Nuko Ishibosheti atanga amategeko ko baja kumukura ku mugabo wiwe Palutiyeli mwene Layishi. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Ariko umugabo wiwe ajana na we, agenda araririra inyuma yiwe inzira yose gushika i Bahurimu. Maze Abuneri amubwira ati: “Subira i muhira!” Nuko aca asubira iwe.<verse eid="2SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Muri ico gihe, Abuneri aganira n’abakuru bo mu Bisirayeli ati: “Haheze igihe mwipfuza ko Dawidi yobabera umwami. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Ubu rero nimubishitse! Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yasezeraniye Dawidi ati: ‘Nzotabara abantu banje b’Abisirayeli nkoresheje umusavyi wanje Dawidi ndabakure mu maboko y’Abafilisitiya no mu maboko y’abansi babo bose.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Abuneri avugana kandi n’Ababenyamini we ubwiwe. Maze aja i Heburoni kubwira Dawidi ivyo Abisirayeli bose n’ab’inzu ya Benyamini bagomba gukora. <verse eid="2SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Igihe Abuneri yashika kwa Dawidi i Heburoni, ari kumwe n’abantu biwe mirongo ibiri, Dawidi yamuteguriye amazimano hamwe n’abo bantu biwe. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Nuko Abuneri abwira Dawidi ati: “Reka ngende nihuta nkoranye Abisirayeli bose ku bwa databuja umwami, kugira ngo mugiriranire isezerano na bo, no kugira ngo uganze aho hose umutima wawe ushaka.” Nuko Dawidi asezera Abuneri agenda amahoro.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yowabu yica Abuneri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Haheze akanya abantu ba Dawidi na Yowabu baratahuka bavuye ku rugamba baza bazanye ivyo basahuye vyinshi. Ariko Abuneri ntiyari akiri kumwe na Dawidi i Heburoni, kuko Dawidi yari yamusezeye kandi yagiye amahoro. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Yowabu n’abasoda bari kumwe na we bashitse, bamubwira ko Abuneri mwene Neri yaje kubonana n’umwami kandi ko umwami yamurungitse akagenda amahoro.<verse eid="2SA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Nuko Yowabu aja kuraba umwami aramubwira ati: “Wakoze ibiki? Abuneri yaje, hanyuma umurungika amahoro, aragenda? <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />Wewe urazi Abuneri mwene Neri. Nta kindi cari kimuzanye atari ukukubesha no gusuma amakuru kugira ngo amenye inzira zawe zose n’ivyo uriko urakora vyose.”<verse eid="2SA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Yowabu aca avana na Dawidi, atuma intumwa kuri Abuneri, bamugarurira kw’iriba ry’i Sira. Ariko Dawidi ntiyabimenya. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Maze Abuneri agarutse i Heburoni, Yowabu amutwara ku ruhande inyuma y’urugi rw’igisagara nk’uwugomba kumwihereranya. Mu ntumbero yo guhora amaraso ya murumunawe Asaheli, Yowabu aca amucumita inkota mu nda, aca arapfa.<verse eid="2SA 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Mu nyuma Dawidi avyumvise, aca avuga ati: “Jewe n’ubwami bwanje turera imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ku bw’ayo maraso ya Abuneri mwene Neri. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Amaraso yiwe aze aje ku mutwe wa Yowabu no ku mutwe w’inzu ya se yose! Mu nzu ya Yowabu ntihaze higere habura umunyamibembe canke uwugwaye ibinyoro canke uwugendera ku kibando canke uwicwa n’inkota canke utagira ico arya.”<verse eid="2SA 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />(Yowabu n’uwo bavukana Abishayi bishe Abuneri kuko yari yarishe murumuna wabo Asaheli mu ntambara y’i Gibeyoni.)<verse eid="2SA 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />Nuko Dawidi abwira Yowabu n’abantu bose bari kumwe na we ati: “Nimwitabagurireko impuzu mwambare amagunira muririre Abuneri.” Umwami Dawidi ubwiwe agendera inyuma y’umuvyimba. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Bahamba Abuneri i Heburoni, kandi umwami aborogera cane ku mva ya Abuneri. N’abantu bose bararira.<verse eid="2SA 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Umwami aririmba iyi ndirimbo yo gucura intimba ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:33">“Mbega Abuneri yari akwiye gupfa nk’uko abagarariji bapfa?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />Amaboko yawe ntiyari aboshwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 3:34">n’amaguru yawe ntiyagira iminyororo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:34">Yapfuye nk’uko umuntu agwa imbere y’abanyakibi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 3:34">Kandi n’abantu bose baramuririra.<verse eid="2SA 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Nuko baraza bose binginga Dawidi ngo agire ico arya kuko hari hakiri ku murango; ariko Dawidi ararahira, avuga ati: “Imana irakabimpanira, mbere birushirije, ninagira ico ntamira, waba umukate canke ikindi cose, izuba ritararenga!”<verse eid="2SA 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Abantu bose baravyumva kandi birabahimbara; mbere ikintu cose umwami yakora carabahimbara. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Nuko kuri uwo musi abantu bose n’Abisirayeli bamenya ko umwami ata ruhara yagize mu kwicwa kwa Abuneri mwene Neri.<verse eid="2SA 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Maze umwami abwira abantu biwe ati: “Mbega ntimubona ko uwu musi mu Bisirayeli hapfuye umugabisha, umuntu ahambaye? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Kandi uwu musi, naho ndi uwimikishijwe amavuta, ndi umunyantegenke, kandi aba bahungu ba Zeruwiya bandusha inkomezi. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aze yishure uwakoze ibi, ibihuye n’ikibi yakoze!”<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ishibosheti yicwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Ishibosheti mwene Sawuli yumvise ko Abuneri yapfiriye i Heburoni, aca aracika intege, kandi Abisirayeli bose bahagarika imitima. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Uwo mwene Sawuli yari afise abagabo babiri bari abakuru mu ngabo. Umwe yitwa Bayana uwundi na we yari Rekabu; bari bene Rimoni w’i Beroti wo mu muryango wa Benyamini. I Beroti ni ahantu hari hahinduwe igice ca Benyamini, <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />kuko abantu b’i Beroti bahungiye i Gitayimu bakabayo nk’inyambukira gushika n’uwu musi.<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />(Yonatani mwene Sawuli yari afise umuhungu yari yaramugaye amaguru yose. Yari amaze imyaka itanu igihe inkuru za Sawuli na Yonatani zivuye i Yezireyeli zashika. Umurezi wiwe aramufata aramuhungana, ariko uwo mukobwa kuko yariko arihuta cane ngo ahunge, aramukorokana, maze aca aba ikimuga. Uwo muhungu yitwa Mefibosheti.)<verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Umusi umwe Rekabu na Bayana, bene Rimoni Umuberoti, bagenda kwa Ishibosheti, bashikayo ari mu ndugumba yo ku murango na we yariko araruhuka mu gihe c’umurango. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6" />Basanga umusanzi w’inzu yari yamye agosora ingano, arasinziriye. Baca barasoboka baramurengana binjira mu nzu haruguru. Maze Rekabu na Bayana bacumita umwami mu nda baca barahunga.<verse eid="2SA 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7" />Bari binjiye mu nzu bamusanga yiryamiye ku buriri bwiwe mu cumba ciwe co kuryamamwo. Bamaze kumucumita bakamwica, baciye bamuca umutwe, hanyuma bahunga bawutwaye, bagenda ijoro ryose bajanye inzira ica mu kiyaya citwa Araba. <verse eid="2SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />Bashitse i Heburoni bereka Dawidi umutwe wa Ishibosheti, babwira umwami bati: “Ng’uwu umutwe wa Ishibosheti mwene Sawuli, umwansi wawe, yagerageje kukwica. Uyu musi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> araguhoye mwami nyeningoma ku bwa Sawuli n’uruvyaro rwiwe.”<verse eid="2SA 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Dawidi yishura Rekabu n’uwo bavukana Bayana, bene Rimoni Umuberoti ati: “Ndahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yantabaye mu ngorane zose, <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />igihe haza umuntu akambwira ngo: ‘Sawuli yapfuye,’ mu kwiyumvira ko anzaniye inkuru nziza, naciye ndamufata ndamwicira i Zikulagi. Iyo ni yo mpembo namuhaye kubera iyo nkuru yari anzaniye! <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />None ntibirushiriza nimba abantu b’inkozi z’ikibi bafashe umuntu atariko urubanza, bakamwicira mu nzu yiwe no mu buriri bwiwe? Mbega sinkwiye kubahanira amaraso yiwe amaboko yanyu yavishije no kubakura kw’isi!”<verse eid="2SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Nuko Dawidi aha itegeko abantu biwe, maze barabica. Babaca ibikonjo vyompi n’ibirenge vyompi, baca bamanika imivyimba yabo ku kidengeri c’i Heburoni. Ariko, umutwe wa Ishibosheti wowo bawuhamba mu mva ya Abuneri yari i Heburoni.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi aba umwami w’Abisirayeli bose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Imiryango yose y’Abisirayeli iragenda, isanga Dawidi i Heburoni, iramubwira iti: “Twebwe turi umubiri wawe n’amaraso yawe. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />Kandi kera, igihe Sawuli yari akiri umwami wacu, ni wewe warongora Abisirayeli mu ntambara. Kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarakubwiye ati: ‘Uzoba umwungere w’abantu banje b’Abisirayeli, kandi uzoba umutware wabo.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Abakuru bose b’Abisirayeli baja kuraba umwami Dawidi i Heburoni, aca agirana na bo isezerano aho nyene i Heburoni imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na bo baca bamurobanuza amavuta ngo abe umwami w’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="2SA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Dawidi yari afise imyaka mirongo itatu igihe yaba umwami, aca amara ku ngoma imyaka mirongo ine. <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />I Heburoni yahamaze imyaka indwi n’amezi atandatu, ari umwami w’umuryango wa Yuda gusa, i Yerusalemu na ho ahamara iyindi myaka mirongo itatu n’itatu aganza Abisirayeli bose.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawidi afata Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Umwami n’ingabo ziwe baja i Yerusalemu gutera Abayebusi, ari bo bamye bahaba kuva kera. Abayebusi babwira Dawidi bati: “Ntuzoshobora kwinjira ngaha; kuko n’aho boba impumyi n’ibimuga bokwirukana.” Abayebusi biyumvira bati “Dawidi ntazoshobora gushika hano.” <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Ariko Dawidi yigarurira igice c’ahitwa Siyoni hazitijwe impome zikomeye, ari ho haciye hitwa Igisagara ca Dawidi.<verse eid="2SA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />Kuri uwo musi, Dawidi abwira ingabo ziwe ati: “Ndanka ivyo bimuga n’izo mpumyi ari bo Bayebusi. Uwushaka kubanesha akwiye guca mu mugende w’amazi kugira ngo abashikire.” Aho ni ho havuye imvugo ivuga ngo: “Impumyi n’ibimuga ntibazokwigera binjira mu kirimba c’umwami.”<verse eid="2SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Nuko Dawidi aba aho hantu hazitijwe impome zikomeye, aca ahita Igisagara ca Dawidi. Aca yagura ico gisagara mu kwubaka izindi nyubakwa zo kuhakingira, uhereye ku musezero w’ahitwa Milo ukaja inyuma n’imbere. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />Maze Dawidi arushaho kuba uwuhambaye, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana Mushoboravyose yari kumwe na we.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Maze, Hiramu umwami w’i Tiro arungika intumwa kuri Dawidi, azirungikana n’ibiti vy’amasederi n’ababaji n’abahinga mu kwubakisha amabuye, maze bubakira Dawidi ikirimba. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />Maze Dawidi aca amenya ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yemeje ko ari we mwami w’Abisirayeli bose kandi ko yashize hejuru ubwami bwiwe kubera abantu biwe b’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Amaze kuva i Heburoni akaja i Yerusalemu, Dawidi arongora izindi ncoreke n’abandi bagore, avyara abandi bahungu n’abakobwa. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Aya ni yo mazina y’abana yavyariye i Yerusalemu: Shamuwa, Shobabu, Natani, Salomo, <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />Ibuhari, Elishuwa, Nefegi, Yafiya, <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />Elishama, Eliyada na Elifeleti.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawidi anesha Abafilisitiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Abafilisitiya bumvise ko Dawidi yasizwe amavuta ngo abe umwami w’Abisirayeli, baraduga n’inkomezi zabo zose bagiye kumurondera ngo bamufate; ariko Dawidi avyumvise aca aja kwinyegeza mu kinyegero. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Maze Abafilisitiya barashika bakwiragira mu kiyaya c’i Refayimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />Nuko Dawidi asiguza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati: “Nduge nje gutera Abafilisitiya? Urabampa mu maboko yanje?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwishura ati: “Genda, nzobatanga nyene mu maboko yawe.”<verse eid="2SA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Nuko Dawidi agenda i Bayali-Perazimu, arabagwanya arabanesha. Maze aravuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yansaturiye inzira imbere y’abansi banje nk’uko amazi asenyura urugomero.” Aho hantu haca hitwa Bayali-Perazimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Abafilisitiya bari batayeho ibigirwamana vyabo, maze Dawidi n’abantu biwe baraza barabitwara.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Ikindi gihe Abafilisitiya bongera kuduga bakwiragira mu kiyaya cose c’i Refayimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />Nuko Dawidi abaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ico yokora, na we aramwishura ati: “Ntubatere ubaturutse imbere, ariko ubazunguruke ubatere uturutse inyuma aharabana na biriya biti vyitwa popula. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Niwumva imirindi mu bushorishori bw’ivyo biti, uce unyaruka, kuko ico kizoba ari ikimenyetso co kukubwira ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agiye imbere yanyu mu gutera ingabo z’Abafilisitiya.” <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Nuko Dawidi akora nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yamutegetse, aca atsinda Abafilisitiya agenda arabica kuva i Geba gushika i Gezeri.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Bazana Isandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Dawidi asubira kwegeranya ingabo zigizwe n’abahizi b’Abisirayeli, bashika ibihumbi mirongo itatu. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />Ubwiwe n’ingabo ziwe zose baragenda baja i Bayala h’i Buyuda kugira ngo bakureyo isandugu y’Imana, yitirirwa rya Zina, ari ryo zina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, avyagiye hagati y’abakerubi bari kuri iyo sandugu. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Bashira ya sandugu y’Imana ku mukogote mushasha bayitwara bayikuye mu nzu kwa Abinadabu yari hejuru ku musozi. Uza na Ahiyo bene Abinadabu, ni bo bayobora inka zikwega uwo mukogote mushasha <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />utwaye iyo Sandugu y’Imana, kandi Ahiyo ni we yayigendera imbere. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Dawidi n’Abisirayeli bose bariko bariginagura imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, baririmba bavuza inanga, amakembe, udushako tw’ingoma n’ibindi bicurarangisho.<verse eid="2SA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Bashitse ku mbuga yo kugosorerako ya Nakoni, Uza agorora ukuboko afata iyo sandugu y’Imana ngo ntihenuke, kuko impfizi zikwega uwo mukogote zari zitsitaye. <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />Maze, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ashavurira cane Uza kuko akoze ibitari vyo. Nuko Imana iramukubita aca arapfa, agwa ngaho nyene i ruhande y’isandugu y’Imana.<verse eid="2SA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Maze Dawidi arashavura kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarakiye Uza. Aca yita aho hantu Perezi-Uza, bisigura “gushavurira Uza”, kandi ni ko hacitwa kugeza n’uno musi.<verse eid="2SA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Dawidi aca atinya <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kuri uwo musi, maze arabaza ati: “Mbega Isandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yoza iwanje gute?” <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Ntiyemera gutwara Isandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ngo ibe aho asanzwe aba mu Gisagara ca Dawidi, ariko aca ayikebereza mu nzu kwa Obedi-Edomu w’i Gati. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />Isandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> iguma mu nzu kwa Obedi-Edomu w’i Gati kumara amezi atatu, kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramuhezagira hamwe n’abo mu nzu yiwe bose.<verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Maze babarira umwami Dawidi bati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarahezagiye abo mu nzu kwa Obedi-Edomu n’ivyo atunze vyose, kubera ya Sandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” Nuko Dawidi aramanuka aja kudugana iyo Sandugu y’Imana ayikura mu nzu kwa Obedi-Edomu ayijana mu Gisagara ca Dawidi bari mu munezero mwinshi. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Abareruye iyo Sandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bamaze kugira intambuko zitandatu, yaca atanga ikimazi c’ishuri n’inyana ivyibushe. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />Dawidi yari yambaye efodi yera, atambira imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’inkomezi ziwe zose. <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />Nuko Dawidi n’Abisirayeli bose, badugana Isandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> batera akamo k’umunezero, bavuza n’inzamba.<verse eid="2SA 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Maze Isandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yinjiye mu Gisagara ca Dawidi, Mikali umukobwa wa Sawuli abirabira mw’idirisha. Abonye umwami Dawidi atamba yiginagura, amugayira mu mutima.<verse eid="2SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Maze bazana ya Sandugu y’Uhoraho bayinjiza muri rya hema Dawidi yari yayishingiye, hanyuma batanga ibimazi biturirwa n’umuriro hamwe n’ivy’ishimwe imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Ahejeje gutanga ivyo bimazi biturirwa n’umuriro n’ivy’ishimwe, ahezagira abantu mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose. <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />Hanyuma aca agaburira umuntu wese mw’isinzi ry’Abisirayeli bari ngaho, abagabo n’abagore umwe wese akamuha umukate, inyama hamwe n’agakate gacumbwe mu nzabibu zumye. Ivyo biheze, bose baca barataha iwabo.<verse eid="2SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Dawidi asubiye iwe guhezagira abo mu nzu yiwe na bo, Mikali umukobwa wa Sawuli araza ngo amuhe ikaze, hanyuma aca amubwira ati: “Mbega icubahiro c’umwami w’Abisirayeli cari hehe, umuntu yiyambura impuzu imbere y’abaguranokazi bashumbiye abagurano biwe, nk’umuntu ata co amaze!”<verse eid="2SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Maze Dawidi aca abwira Mikali ati: “Nariko ndatambira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yantoranije kuruta so n’umuntu wese wo mu ruvyaro rwiwe ngo mbe umurongozi w’abantu biwe b’Abisirayeli, ni we nariko ndigina. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />Kandi, ndashaka kurushaho kuboneka nk’uwutaco amaze, mbere mboneke ndi uwukengeretse cane mu maso yanje! Ariko imbere y’abo baguranokazi wavuze nzorushaho gushirwa hejuru.”<verse eid="2SA 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Maze Mikali umukobwa wa Sawuli ntiyaronka akana gushika arinde apfa.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s1">Isezerano Imana yasezeraniye Dawidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Umwami amaze gushika neza mu ngoro yiwe kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amaze kumuha kuruhuka intambara z’abansi biwe bose bari bamukikije, <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />abwira Natani uwavugishwa n’Imana ati: “Ehe raba jewe mba mu nzu yubatswe n’ibiti vy’amasederi, nayo Isandugu y’Imana iba mw’ihema.”<verse eid="2SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Natani yishura umwami ati: “Ivyo wiyumvira gukora vyose, genda ubikore kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari kumwe nawe.”<verse eid="2SA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Ariko muri iryo joro, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> riza kuri Natani riti:<verse eid="2SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />“Genda ubwire umusavyi wanje Dawidi uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Mbega ni wewe uzonyubakira inzu yo kubamwo? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Sinigeze mba mu nzu kuva igihe nakuriye Abisirayeli muri Egiputa gushika uwu musi. Namye nimuka mva mu kibanza kimwe nja mu kindi, nkibera mw’ihema. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />Ahantu hose nimukiye ndi kumwe n’Abisirayeli bose, hari aho nigeze mbwira umutware n’umwe mu barongozi nabahaye ngo baragire ubwoko bwanje bw’Abisirayeli nti: Ni kuki mutanyubakira inzu mu biti vy’amasederi?’ ”<verse eid="2SA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />“None rero, genda ubwire umusavyi wanje Dawidi uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: Nagukuye mu bwungere aho waragira intama, ndagutoranya ngo ube uwuganza abantu banje b’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />Nabanye nawe aho wagiye hose, kandi naherengeteje abansi bawe imbere yawe. None ngira nkuze izina ryawe ribe nk’amazina y’abahambaye bo kw’isi. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />Kandi nzoha abantu banje b’Abisirayeli aho kuba, ndabateragire ahantu hatekanye ngo bagire inzu yabo bwite, aho batazokwongera kuburagizwa. Abansi babo ntibazosubira kubacinyiza nk’uko bahora babigira kera, <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />uhereye igihe nashiraho abacamanza bo kurongora abantu banje b’Abisirayeli. Nzoguha no kuruhuka intambara z’abansi bawe bose.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2SA 7:11">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we akumenyesheje ko ari we ubwiwe azokwubakira inzu. <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />Imisi yawe niyashira ukaja kuruhuka hamwe na ba sogokuruza bawe, nzohagurutsa uwo mu ruvyaro rwawe wo kugusubirira ku ngoma, akomoka kuri wewe, kandi nzokomeza ubwami bwiwe. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />Ni we azokwubaka inzu yitirirwa izina ryanje, kandi nzokomeza intebe y’ubwami bwiwe ibihe bidashira. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />Nzomubera se, na we azombera umwana. Niyakora ibibi, nzomuhanisha inkoni nk’uko umuvyeyi wese yobikora. <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Ariko urukundo rwanje ntiruzokwigera rumuvako, nk’uko narukuye kuri Sawuli, uwo nagukuye imbere. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />Inzu yawe n’ubwami bwawe bizokwamaho ibihe vyose imbere yanje; intebe y’inganji yawe izokwama ihangamye ibihe bidashira.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Nuko Natani aragenda ashikiriza Dawidi ayo majambo yose y’uko guhishurirwa.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isengesho rya Dawidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Nuko umwami Dawidi arinjira yicara imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, maze avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2SA 7:18">“Jewe ndi iki, yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, kandi n’umuryango wanje wari iki, ko wanshikanye aha hose? <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, nk’aho umenga ibi ntibikwiye mu nyonga zawe, wongeyeko no kuvuga ibizoba ku nzu y’ubwami y’umusavyi wawe muri kazoza. None uko ni ko wama ugirira umuntu buntu, ga yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji?<verse eid="2SA 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />Mbega jewe Dawidi nokubwira ikindi ki? Ko uzi umusavyi wawe, ga yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji! <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Wakoze iki kintu gihambaye wongera ukimenyesha umusavyi wawe, kubera ijambo ryawe kandi nk’uko wabigomvye.<verse eid="2SA 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />Mbega ukuntu uhambaye, ga yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji! Nta n’umwe asa nawe, kandi nta yindi Mana atari wewe, nk’uko twavyiyumviye n’amatwi yacu. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />Kandi ni irihe hanga kw’isi yose rimeze nk’abantu bawe b’Abisirayeli; ihanga Imana yihagurukiye ikaja gucungura kugira ngo ribe iryo yiharije? Izina ryawe warishize hejuru igihe wabacungura ubakuye muri Egiputa. Wakoze ibihambaye biteye ubwoba wirukana amahanga n’ibigirwamana vyayo vyari imbere y’abantu bawe wari wacunguye ubakura muri Egiputa. <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />Wihinduriye abantu bawe b’Abisirayeli kuba abo wiharije ibihe vyose, kandi nawe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, wahindutse Imana yabo.<verse eid="2SA 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />None rero, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana, uze ukomeze iryo sezerano ibihe vyose iryo usezeraniye umusavyi wawe n’inzu yiwe. Uze ukore nk’uko wasezeranye, <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />kugira ngo izina ryawe rirushirize kuba irihambaye. Maze abantu bazovuge bati: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ni Imana y’Abisirayeli!’ Kandi n’inzu y’umusavyi wawe Dawidi izokomerera imbere yawe.<verse eid="2SA 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Mana y’Abisirayeli, wahishuriye ibi umusavyi wawe, uvuga uti: ‘Nzokwubakira inzu.’ None rero umusavyi wawe natewe intege zo kuza ngo ngusenge iri sengesho. <verse eid="2SA 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />None rero <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, uri Imana! Amajambo yawe ni ayo kwizigirwa, kandi usezeraniye umusavyi wawe ibi vyiza bingana bityo. <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />None rero nibiguhimbare guhezagira inzu y’umusavyi wawe, kugira ngo yame imbere y’inyonga zawe ibihe vyose; kuko wewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, ari wewe wabivuze, kandi inzu y’umusavyi wawe izohezagirwa ibihe vyose ku bw’umuhezagiro wawe.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ukunesha kwa Dawidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Inyuma y’ivyo, Dawidi atera Abafilisitiya arabanesha, abagira abagurano biwe mu kubanyaga igisagara kinini citwa Gati.<verse eid="2SA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />Dawidi arongera anesha Abanyamowabu. Abaryamika hasi ku murongo abapimisha umugozi; aca yica ibice bibiri vya bitatu vy’abaryamye, asigaza ica gatatu gusa. Nuko Abanyamowabu atishe abagira abagurano biwe bakama bamuzanira amashikanwa yo kumwisaba.<verse eid="2SA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Dawidi yongera anesha Hadadezeri mwene Rehobu umwami w’i Zoba, igihe yagomba kugarukana icibutso ciwe mu karere k’uruzi Efurate. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />Dawidi amunyaga imikogote igihumbi, abayigenderamwo ibihumbi indwi n’abasoda bagwanira ku maguru ibihumbi mirongo ibiri. Acagagura ibinono vy’amafarasi akwega iyo mikogote, asigaza ayo gukwega imikogote ijana gusa.<verse eid="2SA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Maze Abaramu b’i Damasiko baja gutabara Hadadezeri umwami w’i Zoba, Dawidi abicamwo abantu ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bibiri. <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Aca ashinga ibirindiro i Damasiko ku mugwa mukuru w’i Siriya kandi Abaramu bacika abagurano biwe, bakama bamuzanira amashikanwa yo kumwisaba. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yama aha Dawidi intsinzi aho yaja hose.<verse eid="2SA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />Dawidi afata inkinzo z’inzahabu zari iz’intwazangabo za Hadadezeri azijana i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Mu bisagara vy’i Beta n’i Berotayi vyari ivya Hadadezeri, umwami Dawidi ahanyaga ubutare bwinshi bw’umwakaka.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Maze Towi umwami w’i Hamati yumvise ko Dawidi yanesheje ingabo zose za Hadadezeri, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />aca arungika umuhungu wiwe Yoramu ku mwami Dawidi, kumuramutsa no kumukeza kuko yanesheje Hadadezeri, yahora yama amugwanya. Yoramu agenda ajanye ibikoresho vy’ifeza, vy’inzahabu n’ivy’umwakaka.<verse eid="2SA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />Umwami Dawidi aca yegurira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ivyo bikoresho vyose, nk’uko yari yabigize ku nzahabu n’ifeza yari yakuye mu bihugu vyose yari yaranesheje ari vyo <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />vy’Abanyedomu, Abanyamowabu, Abamoni, Abafilisitiya, n’Abamaleki. Atanga kandi n’iminyago yose yari yakuye kwa Hadadezeri mwene Rehobu umwami w’i Zoba.<verse eid="2SA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />Maze Dawidi aba rurangiranwa avuye kunesha Abanyedomu ibihumbi cumi n’umunani, abatsinze mu Kiyaya c’Umunyu.<verse eid="2SA 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Ashira ibirindiro mu gihugu ca Edomu, mu gihugu cose ahashira ibirindiro, kandi Abanyedomu bose baca baba abagurano ba Dawidi. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yama aha intsinzi Dawidi aho yaja hose.<verse eid="2SA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abakuru bo ku ngoma ya Dawidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Dawidi aganza Abisirayeli bose, akora ibibereye n’ibigororotse ku bantu biwe bose. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Yowabu mwene Zeruwiya ni we yari umukuru w’ingabo; Yehoshafati mwene Ahiludi na we yari umwanditsi w’ivyaja biraba; <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Sadoki mwene Ahitubu na Ahimeleki mwene Abiyatari bari abaherezi; Seraya yari umunyamabanga; <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Benaya mwene Yehoyada yari ajejwe Abakereti n’Abapeleti; kandi abahungu ba Dawidi bari abarongozi.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi na Mefibosheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />Dawidi arabaza ati: “Mbega hoba hari umuntu n’umwe agisigaye mu bo mu muryango wa Sawuli kugira ngo ndamugirire neza kubera Yonatani?”<verse eid="2SA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />Hariho umusuku mu bakozi ba Sawuli yitwa Ziba. Baramuhamagara ngo arenguke imbere ya Dawidi, maze umwami aramubaza ati: “Ni wewe Ziba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">Aramwishura ati: “Umusavyi wawe ndi hano.”<verse eid="2SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />Umwami aramubaza ati: “Nta n’umwe yoba agisigaye mu bantu bo mu muryango wa Sawuli, noshobora kwereka ukugira neza kw’Imana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Ziba yishura umwami ati: “Hariho umuhungu wa Yonatani; amugaye amaguru yose.”<verse eid="2SA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Umwami amubaza ati: “Ari hehe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:4">Ziba aramwishura ati: “Aba kwa Makiri mwene Amiyeli i Lo Debari.”<verse eid="2SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Nuko umwami Dawidi asaba ko bamukura i Lo Debari, kwa Makiri mwene Amiyeli.<verse eid="2SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Mefibosheti mwene Yonatani, umuhungu wa Sawuli ashitse kwa Dawidi, aramwunamira amuha icubahiro.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Dawidi aravuga ati: “Mefibosheti!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Aramwishura ati: “Ndi hano umusavyi wawe.”<verse eid="2SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />Dawidi amubwira ati: “Ntutinye, kuko nzokugirira neza kubera so Yonatani. Nzogukomorera ivyari ivya sogokuru wawe Sawuli, kandi uzohora usangira nanje ku meza yanje.”<verse eid="2SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Mefibosheti arunama avuga ati: “Jewe umusavyi wawe ndi iki, aho unyitaho meze nk’imbwa ipfuye?”<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Nuko umwami atumako Ziba, umusuku wa Sawuli, aramubwira ati: “Mpaye umwuzukuru wa shobuja ivyari ivya Sawuli n’umuryango wiwe. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />Wewe n’abahungu bawe n’abagurano bawe muzomurimira mumuzanire ivyimburwa, kugira ngo umwuzukuru wa shobuja yamane ibikwiye. Kandi Mefibosheti, umwuzukuru wa shobuja, azokwama afungurira ku meza yanje.” (Ico gihe Ziba yari afise abahungu icumi na batanu n’abagurano mirongo ibiri.)<verse eid="2SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Maze Ziba abwira umwami ati: “Umusavyi wawe nzokora ivyo databuja umwami avuze vyose.” Nuko Mefibosheti afungurira ku meza ya Dawidi nk’umwe wo mu bana b’umwami.<verse eid="2SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Mefibosheti yari afise umuhungu yitwa Mika, kandi abo mu rugo kwa Ziba bose bari abagurano ba Mefibosheti. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Maze Mefibosheti aba i Yerusalemu, kuko imisi yose yafungura ku meza y’umwami, kandi yari amugaye amaguru yose.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi anesha Abamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Hanyuma y’ivyo, umwami w’Abamoni arapfa, maze umuhungu wiwe Hanuni amusubirira ku ngoma. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Dawidi ariyumvira ati: “Nzogirira neza Hanuni mwene Nahashi, nk’uko se yangiriye neza.” Nuko Dawidi arungika intumwa ngo zije kumwirura kuko yari yabuze se.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:2">Abantu ba Dawidi bashitse mu gihugu c’Abamoni, <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />abaganwa bo mu Bamoni babwira Hanuni umwami wabo bati: “Wibaza ko Dawidi yubashe so mu kurungika abantu bo kukugarukirako? Aho ntiyabarungitse ngo batate igisagara kugira ngo hanyuma bazoce baza kugitera bagisangangure?” <verse eid="2SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Nuko Hanuni afata ba bantu ba Dawidi, abamwa ubwanwa umusaya umwe, atabura amakanzu yabo kuva aho itako ritangurira, aca arabarungika.<verse eid="2SA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Dawidi avyumvise, aca arungika intumwa ngo zihure na bo, kuko bari buzuye ibiteterwe. Umwami abatumako ati: “Nimugume i Yeriko gushika aho ubwanwa bwanyu buzokurira, hanyuma muze mubone kugaruka.”<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Abamoni babonye ko bakoze ikintu giteye isoni imbere ya Dawidi, baca bahera abasoda b’Abasiriya ibihumbi mirongo ibiri bagwanira ku maguru bava i Beti-Rehobu n’i Aramu-Zoba, n’abantu igihumbi b’umwami Mayaka, n’ibihumbi cumi na bibiri bavuye i Tobu.<verse eid="2SA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Dawidi avyumvise aca arungika Yowabu n’ingabo zose zizi kugwana. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Abamoni baragenda batonda urugamba kw’irembo ry’igisagara cabo, Abarameya b’i Zoba na Rehobu n’abo i Tobu na Mayaka batonda urugamba inyuma y’igisagara.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Yowabu abona ko urugamba rumuturutse imbere n’inyuma; aca atoranya bamwe mu ngabo z’indobanurwa mu Bisirayeli abarungika ngo bagwanye Abarameya. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Abasigaye abazeza murumunawe Abishayi ngo abatware, aca abatuma kugwanya Abamoni. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Yowabu amubwira ati: “Abarameya nibandusha inkomezi, uraza kuntabara; ariko kandi Abamoni nibakurusha inkomezi, ndaza kugutabara. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Nureme kandi tugwane rugabo, tugwanire ihanga ryacu n’ibisagara vy’Imana yacu. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari bukore ivyo abona ko ari vyiza mu nyonga ziwe.”<verse eid="2SA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Maze Yowabu n’ingabo bari kumwe baragenda ngo bagwane n’Abarameya, na bo barabahunga. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Abamoni babonye ko Abarameya bariko barahunga, na bo bahunga Abishayi binjira mu gisagara. Nuko Yowabu arahindukira areka kugwanya Abamoni asubira i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Abarameya babonye ko baneshejwe n’Abisirayeli, basubira gutororokana. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Hadadezeri azana Abarameya bavuye hakurya y’uruzi Efurate; baja i Helamu, barongowe na Shobaki umukuru w’ingabo za Hadadezeri.<verse eid="2SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Dawidi avyumvise, akoranya Abisirayeli bose bajabuka Yorodani baja i Helamu. Abasiriya batonda urugamba ngo baje guhura na Dawidi bagwane na we. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Ariko Abarameya bahunga Abisirayeli, kandi Dawidi yica amajana indwi mu bagwanira ku mikogote n’ibihumbi mirongo ine vy’abagwanira ku maguru. Aca akomeretsa Shobaki umukuru w’ingabo zabo, hanyuma aca agwa aho nyene. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Abami bose batwarwa na Hadadezeri babonye ko baneshejwe n’Abisirayeli, baca bagiriranira amasezerano y’amahoro n’Abisirayeli, bemera kuba abagurano babo no kubakorera.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:19">Maze Abarameya baca baratinya ntibongera gufasha Abamoni.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi na Batisheba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />Mu gihe imvura yaba itanguye kugabanuka hakaza ici, ni ho abami bahora baja mu ntambara. Maze Dawidi arungika Yowabu n’intwazangabo hamwe n’ingabo zose z’Abisirayeli kugwana. Banesha Abamoni hanyuma bugariza igisagara caho citwa Raba, ariko Dawidi wewe yigumira i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Umusi umwe, ku mugoroba Dawidi aravyuka aba aratembera ku nzu yo hejuru y’ikirimba ciwe. Maze ari aho abona umugore ariko ariyuhagira. Uwo mugore yari mwiza cane, <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />maze Dawidi aca arungika umuntu kugira amenye uwo mugore uwo ari we. Uwo muntu amubwira ati: “Urya si Batisheba, umukobwa wa Eliyamu akaba umugore wa Uriya Umuheti?” <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />Nuko Dawidi aca atuma intumwa ngo bamuzane. Aza iwe, maze bararyamana. (Yari yihumanuye avuye mu mihango yiwe.) Nuko araheza ataha iwe. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Uwo mugore aca asama inda hanyuma arungikira ubutumwa Dawidi amubwira ati: “Mfise inda.”<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Nuko Dawidi aca arungikira ubutumwa Yowabu ati: “Ndungikira Uriya Umuheti.” Maze Yowabu aca aramumurungikira. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Uriya ashitse iwe, Dawidi amubaza amakuru ya Yowabu, uko ingabo zimeze n’uko urugamba rwariko ruragenda. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Maze Dawidi abwira Uriya ati: “Manuka uje iwawe woge ibirenge.” Nuko Uriya ava ku kirimba, maze umwami amukurikiza intumwa imushiriye ingabire y’inzimano. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Ariko Uriya ntiyataha iwe, ahubwo aja kwiryamira kw’irembo ry’ikirimba hamwe n’abarinzi ba shebuja.<verse eid="2SA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Babwira Dawidi bati: “Erega Uriya ntiyagiye i muhira iwe.” Maze Dawidi aramubaza ati: “Ko wari uje uva ku rugendo rurerure, ni kuki utatashe i muhira?”<verse eid="2SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Uriya abwira Dawidi ati: “Isandugu y’Isezerano, Abisirayeli n’Abayuda barara mu mahema, kandi na databuja Yowabu n’abantu b’umwami barara mu gahinga. Nogenda iwanje gute nkarya nkanywa nkaryamana n’umugore wanje? Ndahiye wewe nyene sinokora ikintu nk’ico!”<verse eid="2SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Nuko Dawidi aramubwira ati: “Guma ngaha uwundi musi umwe, maze ejo nzokurungika.” Nuko Uriya aguma i Yerusalemu uwo musi n’uwukurikira. <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Dawidi aramutumira ngo basangire ku mfungurwa no ku binyobwa vyiwe, aramuboreza. Ariko ku mugoroba Uriya arasohoka aja kuryama ku gisegure ciwe hamwe n’abarinzi ba shebuja, ntiyigera ataha iwe.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Bukeye mu gitondo Dawidi yandikira ikete Yowabu arirungikana Uriya. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />Muri ryo yanditse ati: “Ushire Uriya imbere aho urugamba rukomeye. Maze muce mumureka wenyene mwigireyo kugira ngo bamurase apfe.”<verse eid="2SA 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Nuko igihe Yowabu yari agicunze igisagara bari bugarije, ashira Uriya mu kibanza yari azi ko hari abagwanyi bakomeye. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Abantu bo muri ico gisagara basohotse kugwanya Yowabu, bamwe mu ngabo za Dawidi barapfa; na Uriya Umuheti na we arapfa.<verse eid="2SA 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Yowabu arungikira Dawidi inkuru zo ku rugamba. <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />Yihanikiriza uwo yari atumye ati: “Niwaheza gushikiriza umwami iyo nkuru y’urugamba, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />umwami ashobora gushavura, agaca akubaza ati: ‘Ni igiki catumye mwegera cane ico gisagara mu kugwana? Ntimwari muzi ko bashobora kubarasa imyampi bari ku ruzitiro? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />Ni nde yishe Abimeleki mwene Yerubi Besheti? Si umugore yamuteye ingasiro ari ku ruzitiro, agaca apfira i Tebezi? Ni iki catumye mwegera uruzitiro?’ Niyakubaza ivyo, uce umubwira uti: ‘Kandi umusavyi wawe Uriya Umuheti na we nyene yapfuye.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Uwatumwe aragenda, maze ashitse abwira Dawidi ivyo Yowabu yamutumye vyose kuvuga. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Uwo yatumwe arongera abwira Dawidi ati: “Abagwanira igisagara baturushije inkomezi maze barasohoka baduterera inyuma y’igisagara, ariko twabashubije inyuma gushika kw’irembo ry’igisagara. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Maze abanyamiheto bari hejuru ku rugo, baca bararasa imyampi ku basavyi bawe, hanyuma bamwe mu bantu bawe barapfa. Kandi n’umusavyi wawe Uriya Umuheti yapfuye.”<verse eid="2SA 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Dawidi abwira iyo ntumwa ati: “Bwira Yowabu uti: ‘Ivyo ntibikubabaze; inkota irya umwe canke uwundi. Bandanya urugamba kuri ico gisagara maze ugisambure.’ Uvuge ivyo kugira ngo uremeshe Yowabu.”<verse eid="2SA 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Muka Uriya yumvise ko umugabo wiwe yapfuye, aramugandarira. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Ikigandaro giheze, Dawidi amuzana iwe, aba umugore wiwe maze avyarana na we umuhungu. Ariko ico umwami Dawidi yakoze kibabaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Natani aserura icaha ca Dawidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atuma Natani kuri Dawidi. Ashitse aho ari, amubwira ati: “Mu gisagara kimwe hariho abagabo babiri, umwe yari umutunzi, uwundi yari umukene. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Uwo mutunzi yari afise intama nyinshi cane n’ibindi bitungwa, <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />ariko wa mukene we nta kindi yari afise atari akagazi k’intama kamwe yari yaraguze. Yarakoroye, karakura kabana na we n’abana biwe. Karya ku ndya ziwe, kakanywera ku gikombe ciwe, kakaryama mu maboko yiwe. Kari kameze nk’agakobwa kiwe.”<verse eid="2SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />“Maze haza umushitsi kwa wa mutunzi, ariko ntiyakura muri za ntama ziwe canke mu bindi bitungwa, ivyo kuzimana umushitsi wiwe. Ahubwo, aragenda afata ka gatama ka wa mworo aba ari ko abaga azimana uwo mushitsi.”<verse eid="2SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Dawidi ishavu riramurya, abwira Natani ati: “Ndahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, uwo muntu yakoze ivyo akwiye gupfa! <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Ategerezwa kuriha ako kagazi k’intama incuro zine, kuko yakoze ikintu nk’ico ntagire akagongwe.”<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Maze Natani abwira Dawidi ati: “Uwo muntu ni wewe! Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli avuze: ‘Nagusize amavuta ngo ube umwami w’Abisirayeli, ndagukura mu kuboko kwa Sawuli. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />Naguhaye inzu ya shobuja, n’abagore biwe ndabashira mu maboko yawe. Naguhaye ingoma ya Isirayeli n’iya Yuda. Kandi nimba ivyo vyari bike, nari kukwongera n’ibindi. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />None ni kuki wakengereye ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ugakora ikintu kibi nk’ico mu nyonga ziwe? Wicishije Uriya Umuheti inkota y’Abamoni, maze uca wigarurira umugore wiwe umugira rwawe. <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />None rero, uhereye ubu, inkota ntizova mu nzu yawe, kuko wankengereye ugatwara umugore wa Uriya Umuheti ukamugira rwawe.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Kubera ivyo wakoze, nzotuma ivyago bikuzako bivuye mu bo mu nzu yawe. Nzofata abagore bawe ndabahe umuntu wa hafi yawe, aryamane na bo ku murango izuba riva. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Ivyo wakoze wabikoze mw’ibanga, ariko jeho nzobikora ku murango izuba ryaka imbere y’Abisirayeli bose.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Nuko Dawidi aratura abwira Natani ati: “Naracumuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:13">Natani aramwishura ati: “Ni vyo, mugabo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakugiriye ikigongwe ntugipfuye kubera ico caha. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Ariko, kubera agakengerwe kangana gatyo werekanye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu gukora ivyo, wa mwana wavyara wewe arapfa.”<verse eid="2SA 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Natani amaze gutaha, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atuma wa mwana muka Uriya yavyarana na Dawidi agwara. <verse eid="2SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Dawidi asabira uwo mwana ku Mana kugira ngo amureke abeho. Arisonzesha, aja mu nzu yiwe amara amajoro yitembagaza hasi yambaye amagunira. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Abakuru b’umuryango wiwe bahagarara i ruhande yiwe ngo bamwinginge ave hasi, ariko aranka, kandi ntiyagira ico afungurana na bo.<verse eid="2SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Ku musi ugira indwi wa mwana arapfa. Abishikira ba Dawidi baratinya kubimubwira, kuko biyumvira bati: “Ko yakoze ivyo, ntatwumvirize igihe uwo mwana yari akiriho, twomubwira gute ko umwana yapfuye? Erega yohava akora igikorwa c’uwihebuye.”<verse eid="2SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Dawidi abona abantu biwe bariko barongorerana aca amenya ko wa mwana yapfuye. Arababaza ati: “Wa mwana yapfuye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:19">Baramwishura bati: “Egome, yapfuye.”<verse eid="2SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Nuko Dawidi ava hasi. Ahejeje kwiyuhagira, yisiga amavuta yambara n’impuzu ziwe, aja mu ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramuhimbaza. Maze aca yisubirira iwe, asaba ko bamuzanira imfungurwa, maze arafungura.<verse eid="2SA 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Abasuku biwe baramubaza bati: “Ni kuki ukoze uko? Umwana akiriho, warisonzesheje urarira, ariko ubu umwana apfuye, urahagurutse urafungura!”<verse eid="2SA 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />Arabishura ati: “Umwana akiriho, narisonzesheje ndarira. Nariyumviriye nti: ‘Nta wubizi, kumbure, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ashobora kungirira ubuntu umwana agakira.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Ariko ko yapfuye, nokwisonzeshereza iki? Mbega nosubira kumuzura? Jewe nzomusanga iyo ari, ariko we ntazogaruka aho ndi.”<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />Nuko Dawidi aremesha umugore wiwe Batisheba, aragenda aryamana na we. Maze Batisheba asama iyindi nda avyara umwana w’umuhungu, bamwita Salomo. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramukunda; <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />maze kuko yamukunze, aca atuma uwavugishwa na we Natani ngo bamwite Yedidiya (risobanurwa ngo uwukunzwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>).<verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Muri ico gihe nyene, Yowabu yari yateye i Raba mu Bamoni araheza afata umugwa mukuru w’umwami waho. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Yowabu aca atuma intumwa kuri Dawidi, kumubwira ziti: “Nagwanye n’abantu b’i Raba kandi nafashe igisagara c’umugende ubaha amazi. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Ubu rero, koranya ingabo zisigaye zose kugira ngo uze wugarize hanyuma ufate igisagara cose. Bitabaye uko nohava ndagifata, hanyuma abantu bagaca bakinyitirira.”<verse eid="2SA 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Nuko Dawidi akoranya ingabo zose aja i Raba, arahatera arahafata. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Yambura umwami waho urugori rw’ubwami rwari ku mutwe wiwe, asanga rufise uburemere bw’italanto imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 34.</char></note> y’inzahabu, kandi rwari rusharijwe n’utubuye tw’agaciro, baca barwambika Dawidi. Atwara iminyago myinshi akuye muri ico gisagara, <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />atwara n’abantu bo muri ico gisagara, abashingira ibikebere, bamwe baba abasatura imbaho, abandi bagakoresha amasipiri n’incabiti, abandi bagasatura amabuye, abandi na bo bagafyatura amatafari. Ivyo abikora mu bisagara vyose vy’Abamoni. Hanyuma Dawidi n’ingabo zose basubira i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Amunoni yonona Tamari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Inyuma y’ivyo, Amunoni mwene Dawidi akunda cane Tamari, umukobwa mwiza bavukana kandi akaba mushiki wa Abusalomu uwundi muhungu wa Dawidi.<verse eid="2SA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Amunoni agira ivyipfuzo vyinshi bimurengeye gushika aho amera nk’uwugwaye kubera ivyo vyipfuzo. Kubera yuko Tamari atari bwigere aryamana n’umugabo, Amunoni abona ko ata kuntu ashobora kumuronka.<verse eid="2SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Ariko Amunoni yari afise umugenzi yitwa Yonadabu mwene Shimeya, umuvukanyi wa Dawidi. Yonadabu yari umuntu aciye akenge. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Umusi umwe, abaza Amunoni ati: “Ni igiki gituma, wewe umwana w’umwami, uboneka wacitse intege uko imisi ihera? Ntiwobimbwira?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:4">Amunoni aramubwira ati: “Nkunda cane Tamari, mushiki wa Abusalomu umuvukanyi.”<verse eid="2SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Yonadabu aca amubwira ati: “Reka ndakubwire uko ubigenza: genda uryame wigire nk’uwugwaye. Maze so niyaza kukuraba, uce umubwira uti: ‘Nshaka ko mushikanje Tamari yoza anzaniye ivyokurya. Abitegurire aho mbona hanyuma aheze abinyihere.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Nuko Amunoni araryama yigira uwugwaye. Maze umwami aje kumuraba, Amunoni amubwira ati: “Nashaka ko mushikanje Tamari yoza agategurira udukate imbere yanje aho mbona, kugira ngo nshobore kuturya antamitse.”<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Dawidi atumako Tamari ku kirimba ati: “Genda ku nzu ya musazawe Amunoni umutegurire ico arya.” <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Maze Tamari aja kwa musazawe Amunoni, na we akaba yari aryamye. Atwara ifu, arayicumba, akora udukate mu maso yiwe aratwotsa. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Nuko afata isahani maze amuzanira twa dukate, ariko yanka kurya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:9">Amunoni avuga ati: “Sohora abari hano bose.” Maze bose barasohoka. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Nuko Amunoni abwira Tamari ati: “Nzanira ivyo vyokurya ku buriri ubinyihere.” Maze Tamari yakira twa dukate yari yateguye atuzanira musazawe Amunoni mu cumba yaryamamwo. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Ariko amuhereje ngo yakire arye, aca aramusumira aramufata amubwira ati: “Mushikanje Tamari, emera turyamane.”<verse eid="2SA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Aramwishura ati: “Oya, mwana wa data. Kandi ntumfate ku nguvu! Ikintu nk’ico ntigikwiye gukorwa mu Bisirayeli! Ntukore ikibi nk’ico. <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Mbega noheza ivyo biteterwe nkabijana hehe? Mbere na wewe woba ubaye nk’umwe mu bipfamutima vyo muri Isirayeli. Ndakwinginze vugana n’umwami; kuko atokunyima ngo undongore.” <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Ariko ntiyamwumviriza, kandi kuko yamurusha inkomezi, amufata ku nguvu asambana na we.<verse eid="2SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Nuko Amunoni aca amwanka urunuka. Ndetse urwanko yamwanse rusumba urukundo yari yamukunze. Amunoni aca amubwira ati: “Va ngaha, sohoka!”<verse eid="2SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Tamari amwishura ati: “Oya reka kunyirukana, kuko woba ukoze ikindi kibi kiruta n’ico umaze kunkorera.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:16">Ariko ntiyamwumviriza. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Ahamagara umukozi wiwe ati: “Sohora uwu mukobwa ave hano uce wugara urugi.” <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Nuko wa mukozi wiwe aca aramusohora, maze yugara urugi. Yari yambaye ikanzu nziza y’igiciro isharijwe amabara menshi, kuko ari ko abakobwa b’umwami batarigera baryamana n’abagabo bambara. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Tamari aca yisiga iminyota ku mutwe atabagura na ya kanzu y’amabara y’igiciro yari yambaye. Aca yikorera amaboko agenda araboroga inzira yose.<verse eid="2SA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Musazawe Abusalomu aca amubwira ati: “Mbega Amunoni, musazawe yari kumwe nawe? Ihorere, mushikanje; ni musazawe. Ntubishireko umutima.” Maze Tamari aca aja kuba mu nzu kwa musazawe Abusalomu, amera nk’umugore yahebwe.<verse eid="2SA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Umwami Dawidi avyumvise, arashavura cane. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Abusalomu ntiyigera asubira kuvugisha ikintu na kimwe Amunoni, caba ciza canke kibi; yaramwanka cane kuko yononye mushikiwe Tamari.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abusalomu yihora Amunoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Imyaka ibiri iheze, mu gihe abamwa ubwoya bw’intama za Abusalomu bari i Bayali-Hazori hafi y’urugabano rwa Efurayimu, Abusalomu aca atumira abahungu b’umwami bose ngo baze mu musi mukuru. <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Abusalomu ashikira umwami amubwira ati: “Umusavyi wawe naramutse nkoresha abamwa ubwoya bw’intama. Mbega umwami n’abanyacubahiro biwe bontera iteka ryo kuza kwifatanya nanje?”<verse eid="2SA 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Umwami aramwishura ati: “Oya mwana. Twese ntitwoza; twohava tukubera umuzigo.” Naho Abusalomu yagumye amwinginga cane, ntiyamwemerera kugenda, ariko aramuhezagira.<verse eid="2SA 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Nuko Abusalomu aca avuga ati: “Ko bidashobotse, ndakwinginze undungikire umuvukanyi wanje Amunoni wewe aze tujane.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">Umwami aramubaza ati: “Ni kuki ugomba ko ajana nawe?” <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Ariko Abusalomu aramugobera cane, maze arateba aremera ko bajana na Amunoni n’abandi bahungu b’umwami bose.<verse eid="2SA 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Abusalomu aca atanga itegeko ku bantu biwe ati: “Umviriza! Murindire kugeza igihe Amunoni azoba amaze kunywa umuvinyu akaborerwa nca ndababwira nti: ‘Mwice,’ muce mumwica. Ntimutinye. Si jewe ndabibabwiye? Mukomere ntimutinye.” <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Nuko rero abantu ba Abusalomu baronse ikimenyetso baca bica Amunoni nk’uko Abusalomu yari yabategetse. Nuko abahungu b’umwami bose bava hasi, burira indogoba zabo bariruka barahunga.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Bakiri mu nzira, inkuru ishikira Dawidi ivuga iti: “Abusalomu yishe abahungu b’umwami bose; nta n’umwe muri bo yasigaye.” <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Umwami arahaguruka, yitabagurirako impuzu yicara hasi; maze abagendanyi biwe bahagarara i ruhande yiwe bitabaguriyeko impuzu zabo.<verse eid="2SA 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Ariko Yonadabu mwene Shimeya, uwo bavukana na Dawidi avuga ati: “Umwami wanje ntiyibwire ko bishe abaganwa bose; Amunoni wenyene ni we yapfuye. Ivyo ni ivyo Abusalomu yari yaragize umugambi kuva umusi Amunoni yonona mushikiwe Tamari. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Nyakwubahwa mwami ntushire umutima kuri iyo nkuru ivuga ko abahungu b’umwami bose bapfuye. Ni Amunoni wenyene yapfuye.”<verse eid="2SA 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Ariko Abusalomu we, yari yahunze.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:34">Hanyuma umuteramyi ari ku rugo rw’i Yerusalemu agize gutya, abona abantu benshi bariko baraza bamanuka umusozi mw’ibarabara riva mu burengero. Uwo muteramyi ariruka abibwira umwami ati: “Ndabonye abantu baje bava i Horonayimu, bari mu mbavu z’umusozi.”<verse eid="2SA 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Yonadabu aca abwira umwami ati: “Ehe, abahungu b’umwami barashitse; bibaye nk’uko umusavyi wawe yabivuze.”<verse eid="2SA 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Agiheza kuvuga, abahungu b’umwami binjira baboroga cane. Umwami na we nyene, n’abakozi biwe, barirana na bo cane.<verse eid="2SA 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />Abusalomu na we arahunga aja kwa sekuru Talumayi mwene Amihudi, umwami w’i Geshuri. Maze Dawidi agandarira umuhungu wiwe Amunoni imisi myinshi.<verse eid="2SA 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Abusalomu na we arahunga aja i Geshuri, amarayo imyaka itatu. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Ariko umwami Dawidi amaze kwirurwa umubabaro wa Amunoni atangura kwiyumvira ingene yosubiza hamwe na Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Abusalomu asubira i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Yowabu mwene Zeruwiya amenya ko umutima w’umwami ukumbuye Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Nuko Yowabu aca arungika umuntu i Tekowa aronderayo umugore w’umunyabwenge. Amubwira ati: “Niwigire nk’uwugandaye. Wambare impuzu zo kugandara, kandi ntiwisige amavuta. Wigire nk’umugore amaze imisi myinshi ababajwe n’uwapfuye. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Maze uce uja ku mwami umubwire aya majambo.” Maze Yowabu amubwira amajambo ategerezwa kuvuga.<verse eid="2SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Wa mugore w’i Tekowa agiye kuraba umwami, aramwunamira, amubwira ati: “Mwami Nyeningoma, mfasha!”<verse eid="2SA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Umwami aramubaza ati: “Ni ibiki bikugoye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Wa mugore aca avuga ati: “Jewe ndi umupfakazi; umugabo wanje yarapfuye. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Jewe umusavyikazi wawe nari mfise abahungu babiri. Maze bagwanira mu murima, ata n’umwe wo kubabanguranya. Umwe akubita uwundi maze aramwica. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />None umuryango wose wahagurukiye umusavyikazi wawe; bavuga bati: ‘Tanga uwo yishe umuvukanyi wiwe, kugira ngo na we yicwe azize ko yishe uwo bavukana. Ntabereye kuzoragwa ikintu na kimwe co mu muryango.’ Uko ni ko bagomba kuzimya ikara rimwe ryari rikiriko riraka, ngo ntibasigarane izina umugabo wanje canke uwumukomokako n’umwe kw’isi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Umwami abwira wa mugore ati: “Itahire, nanje ndatanga itegeko rigukiza.”<verse eid="2SA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Ariko wa mugore w’i Tekowa aramubwira ati: “Mwami nyeningoma, reka igicumuro kigume kuri jewe no ku muryango wa data, ariko umwami n’ingoma yiwe ntihagire ikimwagiriza.”<verse eid="2SA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Umwami aramwishura ati: “Nihagira uwukubwira ijambo na rimwe, uze umunzanire, ntazosubira kukugora.”<verse eid="2SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Wa mugore aravuga ati: “Umwami natakambire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe kugira ngo umuhozi ntasese amaraso ku yandi, mu kwica umuhungu wanje.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:11">Umwami avuga ati: “Nkurahiye Uguhoraho k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nta n’agashatsi ko ku mutwe w’umuhungu wawe kazokorokera hasi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Nuko wa mugore aca avuga ati: “Mwami Nyeningabo, nyemerera jewe umusavyikazi wawe ngire ico ndakubwiye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:12">Aramwishura ati: “Vuga.”<verse eid="2SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Wa mugore aravuga ati: “Ni kuki wateguye gukorera ubwoko bw’Imana ikibi nk’ico? Mbega umwami ko avuze atyo, ntiyitsindishije ko atagarukanye umuhungu wiwe yangarijwe mu mahanga? <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Nk’uko amazi asesetse atayorwa, ni ko natwe tuzopfa twese. Ariko ubwo si bwo bugombe bw’Imana, ahubwo yoyo irondera inzira yo kutugarukana iyo twatandukanye na yo.<verse eid="2SA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />Ubu rero nazanywe no kubwira iryo jambo umwami wanje kuko abantu banteye ubwoba. Umusavyikazi wawe niyumviriye nti: ‘Reka ngende tuvugane n’umwami; kumbure yokora ico umusavyikazi wiwe amusavye. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />Kumbure umwami yokwemera gutabara umusavyi wiwe akamukura mu kuboko kw’umuntu agomba kunyaga jewe n’umuhungu wanje umugabane twahawe n’Imana.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />“None rero umusavyikazi wawe navuga nti: ‘Icompa ijambo ry’umwami wanje rikanzanira gutekanirwa mu mugabane wanje, kuko umwami wanje ameze nk’umumarayika w’Imana mu vyo kumenya ikibi n’iciza. Icompa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe akabana nawe.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Maze umwami abwira uwo mugore ati: “Unyishure utampishije na kimwe mu vyo ngiye kukubaza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:18">Wa mugore avuga ati: “Umwami wanje navuge.”<verse eid="2SA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Umwami arabaza ati: “Mbega muri ibi vyose nta kuboko kwa Yowabu kurimwo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:19">Wa mugore aramwishura ati: “Ndahiye wewe nyene, mwami wanje, nta n’umwe ashobora gukebereza i buryo canke i bumoso ku ryo umwami wanje avuze. Egome ni umusavyi wawe Yowabu yambwiye gukora ivyo, ambwira n’ivyo nkwiye kuvuga. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Umusavyi wawe Yowabu yabikoze kugira ngo iki gihe kirangire. Umwami wanje afise ubwenge nk’ubw’umumarayika w’Imana azi vyose mu bibera mu gihugu.”<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Maze umwami atuma intumwa kubwira Yowabu iti: “Ni vyiza, aremeye kubikora. Genda ugarukane uwo muhungu Abusalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Yowabu arunama ashika hasi, araheza ahezagira umwami. Yowabu aravuga ati: “Uyu musi umusavyi wawe menye ko nagiriwe ubuntu imbere yawe, mwami wanje, kuko umwami ahaye umusavyi wiwe ivyo yasavye.”<verse eid="2SA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Nuko Yowabu aja i Geshuri agarukana Abusalomu i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Ariko umwami aravuga ati: “Aze aje mu nzu yiwe, ariko ntaze aze ngo abone mu maso hanje.” Nuko Abusalomu aja mu nzu yiwe ntiyigera aza aho abona umwami.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />Mu Bisirayeli bose nta muntu n’umwe yarangwa ko ari mwiza ku karanga nka Abusalomu. Kuva ku mutwe gushika ku kirenge ciwe nta gasembwa yari afise. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Ku mwaka ku mwaka yarimosha umushatsi kuko yaba yumva umuremereye. Yaca awupima, maze uburemere bwawo bwari shekeli amajana abiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 2,3.</char></note> upimishije umunzane w’i bwami.<verse eid="2SA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Abusalomu yari yaravyaye abahungu batatu n’umukobwa umwe. Uwo mukobwa yitwa Tamari, maze aba mwiza cane.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Abusalomu aba i Yerusalemu atabona umwami mu maso. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Nuko Abusalomu atumako Yowabu kugira ngo amutume ku mwami, ariko Yowabu aranka kumwitaba. Nuko amutumako ubugira kabiri ariko na ho nyene aranka kuza. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Maze abwira abakozi biwe ati: “Murabona, umurima wa Yowabu ukurikirana n’uwanje, kandi arafiseyo ingano. Genda muziturire.” Nuko abakozi ba Abusalomu baragenda baturira wa murima.<verse eid="2SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Nuko Yowabu aca aja kwa Abusalomu aramubwira ati: “Ni kuki abakozi bawe bantuririye umurima?”<verse eid="2SA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Abusalomu abwira Yowabu ati: “Ni kubera nagutumyeko nti: ‘Nuze ndagutume ku mwami kubaza uti: “Ni kuki wankuye i Geshuri? Vyari kumbera vyiza iyo nigumira hariya!” ’ None rero, ndagomba kubona mu nyonga z’umwami, kandi nihaba hari icaha kinyagira, anyice.”<verse eid="2SA 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Nuko Yowabu aja ku mwami amubwira ivyo. Maze umwami atumako Abusalomu, na we araza arunama imbere y’umwami. Umwami aramugumbira.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Abusalomu agerageza gukura se ku ngoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Inyuma y’ivyo, Abusalomu yironkera umukogote n’amafarasi n’abantu mirongo itanu bagendera imbere yiwe. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Agahora avyuka mu gitondo ca kare agahagarara i ruhande y’inzira ija kw’irembo ry’igisagara. Hagira umuntu aharengana afise ikimubabaje agiye kubaza i bwami, Abusalomu agaca amuhamagara ati: “Uva mu gisagara ikihe?” Na we akishura ati: “Umusavyi wawe ndi uwo mu muryango w’Abisirayeli uyu n’uyu.” <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />Maze Abusalomu agaca amubwira ati: “Ehe raba, ivyo uvuga birumvikana kandi uri mu kuri, ariko umwami nta muntu afise wo kubumviriza.” <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Maze Abusalomu agaca yongerako ati: “Ese icari kumpa nkaba umucamanza muri iki gihugu! Umuntu wese afise ivyo arega canke ico apfa na mugenziwe yociye aza iwanje nanje nkamutunganiriza neza.”<verse eid="2SA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Vyongeye, igihe cose umuntu yamwegera akamwunamira, Abusalomu yaca amufata ukuboko akamugumbira. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Abusalomu agakorera ivyo umuntu wese wo mu Bisirayeli agiye gusaba gutunganirizwa ku mwami, gutyo amera nk’uwutwaye imitima Abisirayeli bose, arayigarurira.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Haheze imyaka ine, Abusalomu abwira umwami ati: “Ndagusavye undekure ngende i Heburoni gushitsa isezerano nasezeraniye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />Igihe umusavyi wawe nari i Geshuri muri Siriya, nararahiye nti: <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> niyansubiza i Yerusalemu, nzomushimirira i Heburoni.”<verse eid="2SA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Umwami aravuga ati: “Genda amahoro.” Nuko aja i Heburoni.<verse eid="2SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Maze ari ngaho, Abusalomu aca arungika abantu mu mpisho mu miryango yose y’Abisirayeli kubabwira ngo: “Nimwumva inzamba zivuze, muce muvuga muti: ‘Abusalomu ni umwami yimikiwe i Heburoni.’ ” <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />Abusalomu yari yaherekejwe n’abantu amajana abiri kuva i Yerusalemu. Bari batumiwe nk’abatumire gusa, bagenda batazi na kimwe mu biriko birategurwa. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />Igihe Abusalomu yariko aratanga ibimazi, atumako na Ahitofeli Umunyagiloni, umujenama wa Dawidi, ngo ave mu gisagara ca Gilo aho yaba aze. Nuko abifatanya na Abusalomu bakomeza kuba benshi kandi uwo mugambi wiwe ushishikara gukomera.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawidi ahunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Haza umuntu i Yerusalemu azanye inkuru, abwira Dawidi ati: “Imitima y’Abisirayeli bose iri kumwe na Abusalomu mu nama yo kugukura.”<verse eid="2SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Nuko Dawidi abwira abishikira biwe bose bari kumwe na we i Yerusalemu ati: “Nimuze duhunge ahandi ho nta n’umwe muri twebwe akira inkota ya Abusalomu. Dutegerezwa kuva ngaha ubu nyene, kuko atari uko aradusanga hano aduteze ivyago vyinshi kandi yicishe inkota abari muri iki gisagara bose.”<verse eid="2SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Ba bishikira baramwishura bati: “Abasavyi bawe turiteguye gukora ico umwami ahitamwo cose.”<verse eid="2SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Umwami asohokana n’abo mu rugo rwiwe bose baramukurikira; ariko asiga incoreke icumi ngo zisigare ziritaho ikirimba. <verse eid="2SA 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Nuko Umwami aragenda, ari kumwe n’abantu bamukurikiye, bahagarara ku nzu ya nyuma y’igisagara. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Ingabo za Dawidi zose zica imbere yiwe, Abakereti n’Abapeleti bacungera ubuzima bw’umwami n’abandi amajana atandatu b’Abagati bari babanye na we kuva i Gati baja imbere yiwe.<verse eid="2SA 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />Umwami abwira Itayi Umugati ati: “Ni kuki ujanye natwe? Isubirire inyuma ugumane n’umwami Abusalomu. Wewe uri inyambukira, wahunze uva mu gihugu c’iwanyu. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Waje ejobundi. None uwu musi ntume wangarana natwe, ko ntazi iyo ndiko ndaja? Subira inyuma, ujane n’ab’iwanyu bose. Ukugira neza n’ubwizigirwa vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bibane namwe.”<verse eid="2SA 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Ariko Itayi yishura umwami ati: “Ndahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ndahiye na wewe nyene umwami, aho umwami wanje azoba ni ho nanje nzoba, ari ugupfa canke ugukira.”<verse eid="2SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Dawidi abwira Itayi ati: “Ni vyiza hogi bandanya tugende.” Nuko Itayi Umugati aragenda ajana n’abantu bari kumwe na we n’imiryango bari kumwe.<verse eid="2SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Abantu bose bariko bararira baboroga babonye abantu babacako bagenda. Umwami na we nyene ajabuka umwonga wa Kidironi, kandi n’abantu bose bamukondorera inyuma bagenda berekeye mu bugaragwa.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Sadoki na we nyene n’Abalewi bose bari kumwe na we, bateruye Isandugu y’Isezerano y’Imana. Bashira ya Sandugu y’Imana ngaho, maze Abiyatari atanga ibimazi kugeza abantu bose bahejeje kuva mu gisagara.<verse eid="2SA 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Nuko umwami abwira Sadoki ati: “Subiza iyo Sandugu y’Imana mu gisagara. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ninaba ndamuhimbaye, azongarukana ampe gusubira kuyibona n’ihema ryayo. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Ariko niyavuga ati: ‘ntukimpimbaye,’ na ho nyene nditeguye; nankorere ivyo abona ko bimbereye vyose.”<verse eid="2SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Umwami yongera kubwira Sadoki umuherezi ati: “Mbega wabitahuye? Subira mu gisagara amahoro mwe na Abiyatari n’umuhungu wawe Ahimazi hamwe na Yonatani mwene Abiyatari. Wewe na Abiyatari mujane n’abahungu banyu bompi. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Nanje, nzorindirira mu biyaya vyo kuri Yorodani aho ubugaragwa butangurira gushika aho nzoronkera amakuru mundungikiye.” <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Nuko Sadoki na Abiyatari batwara ya Sandugu y’Imana i Yerusalemu baca bagumayo.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Ariko Dawidi wewe aguma agenda aduga Umusozi wa Elayono, agenda ararira ingenda; agenda yitwikiriye mu maso kandi ata birato yambaye. Abo bari kumwe na bo nyene bitwikira mu maso bagenda bararira uko baduga. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Ico gihe babwira Dawidi bati: “Ahitofeli na we nyene ari mu bagumutsi, ari kumwe na Abusalomu.” Maze Dawidi aca arasenga ati: “Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, hindura ubupfu inama ya Ahitofeli.”<verse eid="2SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Dawidi ashitse ku gatwe k’umusozi, aho abantu bahora basengera Imana, Hushayi Umwaruki ni ho yari aje kumusanganira, yitabaguriyeko impuzu, yisize ivu mu mutwe. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />Dawidi amubwira ati: “Niwajana nanje, uzombera umuzigo. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Ariko niwasubira mu gisagara ukabwira Abusalomu uti: ‘Nzoba umusavyi wawe mwami; nk’uko nahora ndi umusavyi wa so muri kahise, ni ko n’ubu nzoba umusavyi wawe,’ aho ni ho uzomfasha kwica inama za Ahitofeli. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Mbega ntuzoba uri kumwe na Sadoki na Abiyatari abaherezi? Uzobabwire ivyo uzokwumva vyose ku kirimba c’umwami. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Abahungu babo babiri, Ahimazi mwene Sadoki na Yonatani mwene Abiyatari, bari kumwe na bo. Uzobandungikire baze kumbwira ivyo wumvise vyose.”<verse eid="2SA 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Nuko Hushayi umugenzi wa Dawidi ashika i Yerusalemu mu gihe Abusalomu yariko arinjira mu gisagara.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi na Ziba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />Dawidi akiva kuri ka gatwe k’umusozi, ni ho Ziba, umusavyi wa Mefibosheti, yaza aje guhura na we. Yari ku ndogoba zibiri zikwega umukogote wiremetse imikate amajana abiri, udukate ijana ducumbwe mu nzabibu zumye, udukate ijana ducumbwe mu nsukoni n’umukuza w’urusato w’umuvinyu.<verse eid="2SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Umwami abaza Ziba ati: “Ivyo ni ivy’iki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:2">Ziba aramwishura ati: “Izi ndogoba ni iz’abo mu nzu y’umwami ngo bazigendereko, imikate na yo n’ivyamwa ni ivyokurya vy’ingabo, umuvinyu na wo ni uwo guhembura uwuzoba acitse intege mu bugaragwa.”<verse eid="2SA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Nuko umwami arabaza ati: “Umwuzukuru wa shobuja we ari hehe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:3">Ziba aravuga ati: “Yagumye i Yerusalemu, kuko yiyumviriye ati: ‘Uyu musi inzu y’Abisirayeli iransubiza ubwami bwa sogokuru.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Maze umwami abwira Ziba ati: “Ivyari ivya Mefibosheti vyose bibaye ivyawe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:4">Ziba aravuga ati: “Ndaciye bugufi ndunamye. Nze name ngirirwa ubuntu imbere yawe, mwami nyaguhora ku ngoma.”<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shimeyi atuka Dawidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Umwami Dawidi yegereje gushika i Bahurimu, haza umuntu wo mu muryango wa Sawuli avuye muri ico gisagara. Izina ryiwe yitwa Shimeyi mwene Gera, agisohoka atangura kumuvuma. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />Atera amabuye Dawidi n’abishikira biwe bari kumwe na we, naho hariho ingabo zigendera hirya no hino ya Dawidi. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Mu kumuvuma, Shimeyi yavuga ati: “Genda, genda, wa mwicanyi we, ata co umaze! <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> akwishuye amaraso yose washeshe y’abo mu nzu ya Sawuli, uwo wishize ku ngoma yiwe. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahaye ingoma yawe umuhungu wawe Abusalomu. Ubu ugiye mu magorwa kuko washeshe amaraso menshi.”<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Maze Abishayi mwene Zeruwiya abwira umwami ati: “Ni iki gituma iyo mbwa ipfuye ituka umwami wanje? Reka ngende ndamuce umutwe.”<verse eid="2SA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Ariko umwami amwishura ati: “Mbega ivyo bikurabako iki, ga mwana wa Zeruwiya? Nimba ariko arantuka kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabimutumye ati: ‘Tuka Dawidi,’ uri nde kugira ngo umubuze?”<verse eid="2SA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Dawidi aca abwira Abishayi n’abishikira biwe bose ati: “Umwana wanje, akara kanje n’amaraso yanje ariko agerageza kunyica. None ntibirushirije cane kwumvikana, kuri uwu Mubenyamini? Mureke ashishikare antuke, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari we yabimutumye. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />Kumbure <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobona umubabaro wanje anyishure ivyiza ku mivumo ndiko ndavumwa uwu musi.”<verse eid="2SA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Nuko Dawidi n’abantu biwe bashishikara urugendo, maze Shimeyi agendera ku rundi ruhande rw’umusozi, aguma amuvuma amutera amabuye yongera asura inkungugu. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Umwami n’abari kumwe na bo bashika ku nkombe ya Yorodani barushe cane. Baca baruhukira aho.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inama ya Ahitofeli n’iya Hushayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Ico gihe Abusalomu yinjira i Yerusalemu n’Abisirayeli isinzi, kandi Ahitofeli yari kumwe na we. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Nuko Hushayi Umwaruki, umugenzi wa Dawidi, aja kwa Abusalomu amubwira ati: “Umwami nahangame! Umwami ahangame!”<verse eid="2SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Abusalomu abaza Hushayi ati: “Urwo ni rwo rukundo weretse umugenzi wawe? Ni kuki utajanye na we?”<verse eid="2SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Hushayi abwira Abusalomu ati: “Oyaye, uwatoranijwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, n’aba bantu, n’Abisirayeli bose ni we nishikanyeko, kandi nzogumana na we. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />Vyongeye, ni kuki ntogukorera? Mbega sinkwiye gukorera umuhungu nk’uko nakorera se? Ni ko na wewe nzogukorera.”<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Abusalomu abwira Ahitofeli ati: “Tugire inama yawe. Dukore iki?”<verse eid="2SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Ahitofeli amwishura ati: “Ryamana n’incoreke za so abo yasigaranye ikirimba. Aho ni ho Abisirayeli bose bazokwumva ko wacokoye so ku rwego bitagishoboka ko mwiyuzuza, kandi abari ku ruhande rwawe bose bizoca bibatera intege bagushigikire bose.” <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Nuko bubakira ihema Abusalomu hejuru ku kirimba, aca aryamana na za ncoreke za se Abisirayeli bose babibona.<verse eid="2SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />Muri ico gihe inama yatangwa na Ahitofeli yaba ari nk’iyivuye ku Mana. Uko ni ko yaba Dawidi canke Abusalomu bafata impanuro bahawe na Ahitofeli.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Ahitofeli arongera abwira Abusalomu ati: “Nyemerera ntoranye ingabo ibihumbi cumi na bibiri maze iri joro nyene nje guhiga Dawidi iyo yagiye. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Ndamusanga akirushe acitse intege; we n’abo bari kumwe ndabaca ivutu, maze abari kumwe na we bose baca bamuta bahunge. Nica umwami wenyene, <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />nkugarukaneko abantu bose. Urupfu rw’uwo mugabo urondera rutuma abantu bose bagaruka; nawe uce uba amahoro.” <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Iyo nama yasa n’aho ari nziza kuri Abusalomu, hamwe n’abakuru bose bo mu Bisirayeli.<verse eid="2SA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Ariko Abusalomu avuga ati: “Tumako na Hushayi Umwaruki, kugira ngo twumve ivyo avuga.” <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Maze Hushayi ashitse, Abusalomu avuga ati: “Ahitofeli yatugiriye iyi nama. Mbega dukore ivyo yatubwiye? Canke na ho wewe ubivugako iki?”<verse eid="2SA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Hushayi yishura Abusalomu ati: “Impanuro Ahitofeli yatanze uno musi si nziza. <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />Urazi so n’abantu biwe bose ni abagwanyi, kandi ubu banganya ubukare n’idubu batwaye ivyana vyayo. Vyongeye, so ni umugwanyi yagwanye kuva kera; ntaza kurara hamwe n’ingabo ziwe. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Nk’ubu, usanga yinyegeje mw’isenga canke ahandi. Hamwe yotera ingabo zawe ubwa mbere akicamwo na bakeya, uwuzovyumva wese azovuga ati: ‘Hapfuye abantu mu ngabo zakurikiye Abusalomu.’ <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Maze n’umuhizi yari afise umutima urinda nk’uw’intambwe, azoca ashongeshwa n’ubwoba, kuko Abisirayeli bose bazi ko so ari umugwanyi kandi ko abari kumwe na we ari abahizi.<verse eid="2SA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />None rero nokugira iyi nama: reka Abisirayeli bose, kuva i Dani gushika i Berisheba bangana n’umusenyi wo ku kiyaga bakoranire aho uri wewe, hanyuma wewe ubwawe nyene ubaje imbere mu kuja mu rugamba. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Maze tuzomutera aho azoba ari hose, tumugweko nk’uko urume rugwa kw’isi. Nta n’umwe yaba we canke abari kumwe na we bazosigara. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Nibahungira mu gisagara kanaka, Abisirayeli bose bazoca bazana imigozi kuri ico gisagara, bagikwege bakijane mu kiyaya gushika aho ata n’ibuye rizoboneka risigaye rihagaze.”<verse eid="2SA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Abusalomu n’abantu bose b’Abisirayeli baca bavuga bati: “Inama ya Hushayi Umwaruki ni nziza kuruta iya Ahitofeli.” Ivyo vyabaye kubera yuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yagabiye kuburabuza inama nziza ya Ahitofeli kugira ngo ateze ivyago Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Hushayi abwira Sadoki na Abiyatari abaherezi ati: “Ahitofeli yagiriye inama Abusalomu n’Abakuru b’Abisirayeli gukora gutya na gutya, ariko nabahanuye uku n’uku. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />None rero rungika intumwa yo kubwira Dawidi iti: ‘Nturare mu kiyaya ca Yorodani mu bugaragwa; jabuka udatevye, bitari uko umwami n’abantu bari kumwe na we barahona.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Yonatani na Ahimazi bagumye ahitwa Eni-Rogeli. Hari umukobwa w’umugurano yari ashinzwe kubashira inkuru, na bo bagaca bagenda kubibwira umwami Dawidi, kuko batinjira mu gisagara kugira ntibababone. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Ariko umusore umwe arababona aca abibwira Abusalomu. Nuko bompi baca bagenda bihuta kwinyegeza mu nzu y’umuntu yaba i Bahurimu. Yari afise iriba riri mu rugo iwe, baca bamanuka muri ryo. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Umugore wiwe aca afata impuzu ayisasa hejuru y’iryo riba aca yanikirako ingano. Nta n’umwe yamenye ko aho hantu hariyo abantu.<verse eid="2SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Abantu ba Abusalomu barashika babaza wa mugore bati: “Ahimazi na Yonatani bari hehe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Wa mugore arabishura ati: “Bajabutse umugezi.” Ba bantu bararondera ariko ntibabona n’umwe, baca basubira i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Abo bantu bamaze kugenda, ba bahungu babiri barurira bava muri iryo riba baca baja kubwira umwami Dawidi. Baramubwira bati: “Haguruka ujabuke Yorodani ubu nyene; Ahitofeli yabagiriye inama ivuga uku n’uku yo kukugwanya.” <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Nuko Dawidi n’abari kumwe na we bose barahaguruka bajabuka Yorodani. Bwakeye ata n’umwe asigaye hakuno ya Yorodani.<verse eid="2SA 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Ahitofeli abonye ko inama yiwe itumviwe, aca ategura indogoba yiwe ataha iwe mu gisagara c’iwabo. Aca atunganya ivyo mu rugo rwiwe hanyuma ariyahura. Apfuye, bamuhamba hamwe na se.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawidi aja i Mahanayimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Dawidi aja i Mahanayimu, Abusalomu na we ajabuka Yorodani n’Abisirayeli bose. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Abusalomu yari yatoye Amasa ngo abe umukuru w’ingabo mu kibanza ca Yowabu. Amasa yari umuhungu w’umugabo yitwa Yeteri, Umwisirayeli yari yarongoye Abigayili, umukobwa wa Nahashi kandi yavukana na Zeruwiya nyina wa Yowabu. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Abisirayeli na Abusalomu bacumbika mu gihugu c’i Gileyadi.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Dawidi ashitse i Mahanayimu, Shobi mwene Nahashi yava i Raba h’Abamoni, na Makiri mwene Amiyeli yava i Lo Debari, na Baruzilayi Umugileyadi yava i Rogelimu <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />bazana ivyo gusasa, n’amabesani n’ibibumvye mw’ibumba. Bazana n’ingano na sayiri, amafu n’ingano zikaranze, ibiharage n’ubushaza, <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />ubuki, amavuta avuye mu mikuku y’inka, amaforomaji y’inka vya Dawidi n’abantu biwe ngo bafungure. Kuko bavuze bati: “Abantu barashonje, bararushe kandi baranyotewe kubera ubugaragwa.”<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwa Abusalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Dawidi agendura ingabo ziri kumwe na we, ashiraho abagaba ingabo ijana n’abagaba igihumbi. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Dawidi atuma izo ngabo ku rugamba, ica gatatu c’izo ngabo catwarwa na Yowabu, ica gatatu kindi kigatwarwa na murumuna wa Yowabu, Abishayi mwene Zeruwiya, ikindi gice gisigaye kigatwarwa na Itayi Umugati. Umwami abwira ingabo ati: “Na jewe ubwanje ndajana namwe ku rugamba.”<verse eid="2SA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Ariko abantu baravuga bati: “Ntujane natwe; nitwahunga nta n’umwe bigira ico bibwiye mu ngabo za Abusalomu. Mbere naho hopfa igice co muri twebwe nta co vyobabwira; ariko wewe wenyene ungana n’ibihumbi cumi ni wewe baza barondera gusa. Ni co gituma ukwiye gusigara mu gisagara, ukaturungikira abadutabara igihe vyoba bikenewe.”<verse eid="2SA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Umwami arabishura ati: “Ndakora ibibahimbara vyose.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:4">Nuko umwami ahagarara i ruhande y’irembo igihe ingabo zariko zirasohoka ziri mu mice y’ijanajana n’igihumbihumbi. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />Umwami ategeka Yowabu, Abishayi na Itayi ati: “Ndabinginze, mwitondere uwo muhungu Abusalomu, mubikore ku bwanje.” Kandi ingabo zose zarumva aho Umwami yatanga iryo tegeko ryerekeye Abusalomu ariha umukuru wese.<verse eid="2SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />Ingabo za Dawidi zija ku rugamba kugwanya Abisirayeli, maze intambara ibera mw’ishamba ry’Abefurayimu. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Ingabo z’Abisirayeli zineshwa n’abantu ba Dawidi, kandi hapfa abantu benshi cane ibihumbi mirongo ibiri. <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Intambara ikwira mu gihugu cose, kandi abishwe n’ishamba baba benshi kuruta abishwe n’inkota.<verse eid="2SA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Maze abusalomu ahura n’abantu ba Dawidi. Yari ku nyumbu yiwe, hanyuma agerageje guhunga, iyo nyumbu ica musi y’amashami azitanye y’igiti kinini, umushatsi wa Abusalomu ufatwa na ya mashami y’igiti, aguma yenena mu kirere, ariko inyumbu yariko iguma yigira.<verse eid="2SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Umwe muri ba bantu ba Dawidi abibonye, abwira Yowabu ati: “Nabonye Abusalomu yenena ku giti.”<verse eid="2SA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Yowabu abwira uwo muntu amubwiye ivyo ati: “Wamubonye? None ni iki catumye utamwica ngo agwe aho nyene? Naca ndaguha shekeli icumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 115.</char></note> z’ifeza n’umukanda w’abahizi ku rugamba.”<verse eid="2SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Ariko uwo muntu aramwishura ati: “Naho shekeli igihumbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 12.</char></note> zari kuba zaharuwe ziri mu ntoke zanje, sinari gukoza ukuboko ku mwana w’umwami. Twavyiyumviye yuko umwami yategetse wewe na Abishayi na Itayi ati: ‘Mwitondere uwo muhungu Abusalomu ku bwanje.’ <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Iyo mba namwishe nari kuba nigiriye nabi ubwanje, kuko umwami yoruhiye kubimenya nawe ukanyigarama.”<verse eid="2SA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Yowabu aravuga ati: “Singomba guta umwanya ngo ndiko ndavugana nawe.” Nuko yakira amacumu atatu mu ntoke ariruka asanga Abusalomu acenena kuri ca giti kandi akiri muzima, ayamutera mu mutima. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Maze ba basoda cumi batwaza ibigwanisho Yowabu bakikiza Abusalomu, bamucumitira aho nyene arapfa.<verse eid="2SA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Nuko Yowabu aca avuza inzamba, ingabo ziwe zireka gukurikira Abisirayeli, kuko yari abahagaritse. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Bafata Abusalomu baja kumuta mu kinogo kirekire kiri mw’ishamba, baca bakirenzako ibibuye bininibinini. Muri uwo mwanya Abisirayeli bari bahunze, umuntu wese aja iwe.<verse eid="2SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />Akiriho, Abusalomu yari yarashinze inkingi y’icibutso ciwe mu kiyaya c’umwami, kuko yiyumviriye ati: “Nta muhungu mfise ngo aze yibutse izina ryanje.” Aca yita iyo nkingi izina ryiwe, n’uwu musi iracitwa Icibutso ca Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawidi agandara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Nuko Ahimazi mwene Sadoki aravuga ati: “Nyemerera niruke menyeshe iyi nkuru umwami ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amukuye mu maboko y’abansi biwe.”<verse eid="2SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Yowabu aramubwira ati: “Reka, si wewe wo kumenyesha iyo nkuru uwu musi. Nshobora kuzogutuma kumenyesha inkuru uwundi musi, ariko uwu musi ntubikore, kuko umuhungu w’umwami yapfuye.”<verse eid="2SA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Maze Yowabu abwira Umunyakushi ati: “Genda ubwire umwami ivyo wabonye.” Wa Munyakushi yunama imbere ya Yowabu aca ariruka.<verse eid="2SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Ahimazi mwene Sadoki yongera kubwira Yowabu ati: “Ukwo vyogenda kwose, ndakwinginze ndeka nanje nkurikire uwu Munyakushi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">Ariko Yowabu arishura ati: “Muhungu wanje, ni kuki ugomba kugenda? Nta nkuru ufise yotuma uronka ingero.”<verse eid="2SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Aravuga ati: “Egome, ariko nyemerera, nshaka kugenda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:23">Nuko Yowabu aravuga ati: “Iruka!” Maze Ahimazi ariruka aca mu kiyaya asiga wa Munyakushi.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Dawidi acicaye hagati y’ibikingi vy’irembo, umurinzi aduga hejuru ku nzu, ku muryango w’irembo. Aravye, abona umuntu yiruka ari wenyene. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Wa murinzi ahamagara umwami arabimubwira.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:25">Umwami aravuga ati: “Ko ari wenyene, ashobora kuba azanye inkuru nziza.” Wa muntu aguma yegereza.<verse eid="2SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Wa murinzi abona uwundi aje yiruka, aca ahamagara umurinzi w’irembo ati: “Ehe uwundi aje yiruka ari wenyene!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:26">Umwami aravuga ati: “Na we nyene ashobora kuba azanye inkuru nziza.”<verse eid="2SA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Wa murinzi aravuga ati: “Umengo umwe wa mbere yiruka nka Ahimazi mwene Sadoki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:27">Umwami ati: “Ni umuntu mwiza. Azanye inkuru nziza.”<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Maze Ahimazi ahamagara umwami ati: “Vyose ni vyiza!” Yunama imbere y’umwami akoza umutwe hasi aca aravuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe ahimbazwe! Kuko yagabuye abantu bahagurukiye kugwanya umwami wanje.”<verse eid="2SA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Umwami arabaza ati: “Wa muhungu Abusalomu ariho?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:29">Ahimazi arishura ati: “Igihe Yowabu yandungika ivyariko biraba ntivyari bwasobanuke neza, sinamenye ivyo ari vyo.”<verse eid="2SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Umwami aravuga ati: “Hagarara i ruhande urindirire aha.” Nuko aja i ruhande ahagararaho.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Wa Munyakushi arashika aca aravuga ati: “Mwami nyeningoma, niwumve inkuru nziza! <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yagutabaye agukura mu maboko y’abari baguhagurukiye.”<verse eid="2SA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Umwami abaza wa Munyakushi ati: “Wa muhungu Abusalomu nta co yabaye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:32">Wa Munyakushi arishura ati: “Abansi b’umwami wanje n’abomuhagurukira bose ngo bamugirire nabi barakaba nk’uko uwo musore yabaye.”<verse eid="2SA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Umwami aca aracika intege. Aca aja mu cumba co hejuru cari ku muryango w’igisagara aririrayo. Agenda aravuga ati: “Ewe mwana wanje Abusalomu! Mwana wanje, mwana wanje Abusalomu! Iyo mpfuma aba ari jewe mpfa hako wewe upfa; yewe Abusalomu, mwana wanje, mwana wanje!”<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Maze babwira Yowabu bati: “Umwami ariko ararira aborogera Abusalomu.” <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Kandi ingabo zose zumvise umubabaro w’umwami intsinzi bari baronse uwo musi ihinduka ikigandaro, kuko kuri uwo musi ingabo zari zumvise bavuga bati: “Umwami ababajwe n’umwana wiwe.” <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Ingabo zinjira mu gisagara nk’abiyiba nk’uko ingabo zomboka mu kwinjira kubera ibimaramare igihe bahunze mu ntambara. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Umwami yipfuka mu maso araboroga cane ati: “Ewe mwana wanje Abusalomu! Ewe Abusalomu, mwana wanje, mwana wanje!”<verse eid="2SA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Nuko Yowabu yinjira mu nzu aho umwami ari amubwira ati: “Uyu musi utetereje ingabo zose, zagukirije ubuzima n’ubw’abahungu bawe n’ubw’abakobwa bawe n’ubuzima bw’abagore bawe n’incoreke zawe. <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />Ukunda abakwanka ukanka abagukunda. Uyu musi uravyerekanye ko abakuru b’ingabo n’ingabo zose ata co bavuze imbere yawe. Ndabona ko wari kunezerwa iyo Abusalomu aba akiriho natwe twese twapfuye. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Nuko rero sohoka uremeshe ingabo. Ndahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ko nimba udasohotse, nta n’umwe aja gusigara ari inyuma yawe uwu musi. Kandi ivyo biraja kukubera bibi kurusha ivyago vyose vyakubayeko kuva mu buto bwawe gushika uwu musi.”<verse eid="2SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Maze umwami arahaguruka avyagira ku ntebe yiwe yari kw’irembo. Babwira abantu bati: “Umwami avyagiye kw’irembo.” Bose baca bakoranira imbere yiwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Muri ico gihe Abisirayeli bose bari kumwe na Abusalomu, bari bahunze umwe wese aja iwe.<verse eid="2SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawidi agaruka i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Mu miryango yose y’Abisirayeli, abantu bariko baraharira bavuga bati: “Umwami yatubohoye adukura mu maboko y’abansi bacu; ni we yadukijije ukuboko kw’Abafilisitiya. Ariko ehe raba ubu yarahunze igihugu kubera Abusalomu; <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />kandi Abusalomu twari twasize amavuta ngo abe umwami wacu, yaguye ku rugamba. None ko ata co muvuga ku vyerekeye kugarukana umwami?”<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Umwami Dawidi arungika ubu butumwa kuri Sadoki na Abiyatari abaherezi ngo: “Mubaze abakurambere b’Abayuda muti: ‘Ni kuki mwoba abanyuma mu kugarukana umwami mu kirimba iwe, ko ibiriko biravugwa mu Bisirayeli bose vyashikiriye umwami aho ari? <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />Muri abavukanyi banje, akara kamwe n’amaraso amwe nanje. None ni igiki cotuma muba abanyuma kugarukana umwami?’ <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Kandi mubwire Amasa muti: ‘Mbega nturi akara kamwe n’amaraso amwe na we? Imana ize ibimpore, kandi birushirije, nutaba umukuru w’ingabo ziwe mu gishingo ca Yowabu.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Amajambo ya Dawidi yigarurira imitima y’Abayuda bose baca baba nk’umuntu umwe. Batumako umwami bati: “Garuka mwe n’abantu bawe bose.” <verse eid="2SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Umwami aca aragaruka ashika ku nkombe za Yorodani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:15">Abayuda bari baje i Gilugali kugira ngo basanganire umwami bamujabutse Yorodani. <verse eid="2SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Shimeyi mwene Gera, Umubenyamini yaba i Bahurimu, arihuta amanukana n’Abayuda gusanganira umwami Dawidi. <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Yari kumwe n’Ababenyamini igihumbi, hamwe na Ziba umuzezwabintu wo mu nzu ya Sawuli, n’abahungu biwe icumi na batanu n’abagurano mirongo ibiri. Baranyaruka baja kuri Yorodani, aho umwami yari ageze. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Baca barihuta kujabuka ngo baje kujabukana ab’inzu y’umwami no gukora ico yogomba cose.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:18">Shimeyi mwene Gera ajabutse Yorodani, aca yikubita hasi yubama imbere y’umwami <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />aramubwira ati: “Icompa umwami ntamparureko icaha canje. Ntiwibuke ivyo umusavyi wawe nagucumuyeko igihe umwami wanje yava i Yerusalemu. Icompa umwami akavyirengagiza. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />Kuko jewe umusavyi wawe nzi ko nacumuye, ariko uwu musi nabaye uwa mbere mu b’inzu ya Yosefu kumanuka gusanganira umwami wanje.”<verse eid="2SA 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Maze Abishayi mwene Zeruwiya aravuga ati: “Shimeyi akwiye kwicwa, kubera yavumye uwo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yimikishije amavuta.”<verse eid="2SA 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Dawidi aramwishura ati: “Ivyo bibatwaye iki ga bene Zeruwiya? Ni kuki mumbereye nk’abangwanya? Mbega hari uwokwicwa uwu musi mu Bisirayeli? Mbega sinzi ko uwu musi ndi umwami w’Abisirayeli?” <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Nuko umwami abwira Shimeyi ati: “Ntugipfuye.” Maze umwami aramurahira.<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Mefibosheti, umwuzukuru wa Sawuli, na we nyene aramanuka gusanganira umwami. Kuva umusi umwami yaviriye i Yerusalemu n’umusi yagarukiyeko amahoro, ntiyari bwakure ubwanwa canke ngo yoge ibirenge canke ngo amesure impuzu ziwe. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Igihe yava i Yerusalemu aja gusanganira umwami, umwami aramubaza ati: “Ni kuki utajanye nanje, ga Mefibosheti?”<verse eid="2SA 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />Amwishura ati: “Mwami nyeningoma, kuko umusavyi wawe mugaye, nabwiye Ziba nti: ‘Ntegurira indogoba kugira ngo njane n’umwami.’ Ariko Ziba umugurano wanje yarambeshe. <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />Yaranambesheye jewe umusavyi wawe ku mwami wanje avuga ko nanse kuza. Ariko, wewe mwami wanje uri nk’umumarayika w’Imana; nuko rero nukore ikiguhimbaye cose. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Abo mu muryango wa sogokuru nta kindi bari bakwiye atari urupfu mu nyonga zawe, ariko wahaye umusavyi wawe ikibanza ku meza yawe. Mbega hari ikindi nosaba imbere y’umwami wanje?”<verse eid="2SA 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Umwami aramubwira ati: “Ni kuki uvuga vyinshi? Ntegetse ko wewe na Ziba mugabura imirima.”<verse eid="2SA 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Mefibosheti abwira umwami ati: “Mureke atware vyose, igikuru ni uko umwami wanje agarutse amahoro.”<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Baruzilayi Umugileyadi na we aramanuka avuye i Rogelimu ngo ajabukane Yorodani n’umwami anamuherekeze asubiye iwe. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Uwo Baruzilayi yari ashaje cane, afise imyaka mirongo umunani. Ni we yagaburiye umwami igihe yari i Mahanayimu, kuko yari umutunzi cane. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Umwami abwira Baruzilayi ati: “Jabukana nanje uce ugumana nanje i Yerusalemu, nanje nzoguha ibikwiye vyose.”<verse eid="2SA 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Ariko Baruzilayi arishura ati: “Mbega nsigaje imyaka ingahe yo kubaho, ku buryo nodugana nawe ga mwami i Yerusalemu? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Ubu maze imyaka mirongo umunani. Mbega ndacatandukanya ikibi n’iciza? Mbega umusavyi wawe ndacamenya ibiryoshe n’ibibishe vyaba ivyokurya canke ivyo kunywa? Ndacumva amajwi y’abaririmvyi baba abagabo canke abagore? None ni igiki cotuma jewe umusavyi wawe ndakubera umutwaro ga mwami wanje nyeningoma? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Umusavyi wawe ndajabukana Yorodani nawe ndaguherekeze gatoya, ariko ni iki cotuma umwami ampa impembo ingana ityo? <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />Reka umusavyi wawe nisubirire inyuma, kugira ngo nze mpfire mu gisagara c’iwacu mpambwe i ruhande y’imva za data na mama. Ariko ng’uwu umusavyi wawe Kimuhamu. Reka ajabukane nawe mwami. Uze umukorere ibiguhimbaye vyose.”<verse eid="2SA 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Umwami aravuga ati: “Kimuhamu arajabukana nanje, kandi nzomukorera ivyo ushaka vyose. Ivyo wipfuza vyose, nzobikora ku bwawe.”<verse eid="2SA 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Nuko abantu bose bajabuka Yorodani, maze n’umwami arajabuka. Umwami agumbira Baruzilayi aramuhezagira, maze Baruzilayi asubira iwe.<verse eid="2SA 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Umwami amaze kujabuka hakurya i Gilugali, Kimuhami ajabukana na we. Ingabo zose z’Abayuda n’igice c’ingabo z’Abisirayeli baherekeza umwami.<verse eid="2SA 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Maze abantu bose b’Abisirayeli baza aho umwami ari, bitwarira abo mu muryango wa Yuda bati: “Ni kuki abavukanyi bacu b’Abayuda, batwivye umwami bakongera bakamujabukana Yorodani bamugarukanye hamwe n’ab’inzu yiwe bose, n’ingabo zose za Dawidi zari kumwe na we bonyene?”<verse eid="2SA 19:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Abantu bose b’Abayuda bishura Abisirayeli bati: “Twabikoze kuko umwami ari uwo mu muryango wacu wa hafi. None ni kuki bibashavuje? Hari ivyokurya vy’umwami twariye twenyene? Mbega hari ikintu na kimwe twatwaye ciwe ngo tukigire icacu?”<verse eid="2SA 19:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Nuko ingabo z’Abisirayeli zishura ingabo z’Abayuda ziti: “Dufise imigabane icumi ku mwami; kandi i ruhande y’ivyo, muri Dawidi dufise vyinshi kubarusha. None ni iki gituma mudukengera? Ntituri aba mbere batanguye kuvuga ivyo kugarukana umwami wacu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:43">Ariko abantu b’i Buyuda bishurana amajambo akaze kurusha Abisirayeli.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Sheba agarariza Dawidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />I Gilugali hari umuntu w’imburakimazi yitwa Sheba mwene Bikuri, Umubenyamini. Avuza inzamba arasemerera ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">“Nta mugabane dufise kuri Dawidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 20:1">nta mugabane kuri mwene Isayi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">Yemwe Bisirayeli, umuntu wese niyigire iwe!”<verse eid="2SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Nuko Abisirayeli bava inyuma ya Dawidi bakurikira Sheba mwene Bikuri. Ariko Abayuda baguma inyuma y’umwami wabo kuva kuri Yorodani gushika i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />Dawidi asubiye ku kirimba iwe i Yerusalemu, afata za ncoreke icumi yari yasize ngo basigarane ikirimba abashira mu nzu barindirwamwo. Abategekaniriza ivyo bakeneye vyose, ariko ntiyasubira kuryamana na bo. Barindirwa ngaho gushika bapfuye, babaho nk’abapfakazi.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Nuko umwami abwira Amasa ati: “Tumako abantu b’i Buyuda baze aho ndi bitarenze imisi itatu, kandi nawe ubwawe uzobe ari ho uri.” <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Ariko Amasa agiye guhamagara Abayuda, amarayo umwanya munini uruta uwo umwami yari yamuhaye.<verse eid="2SA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Dawidi abwira Abishayi ati: “Ubu Sheba mwene Bikuri azotugirira ibibi biruta ivyo Abusalomu yatugiriye. Jana n’abantu ba shobuja umukurikire, kugira ngo ntahave yinjira mu bisagara bizitijwe inzitiro akadusiga.” <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Nuko ingabo za Yowabu n’Abakereti n’Abapeleti n’abahizi bose barasohoka barongowe na Abishayi. Bava i Yerusalemu bakurikira Sheba mwene Bikuri.<verse eid="2SA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Bakiri ku gitandara kinini c’i Gibeyoni, Amasa aza kubasanganira. Yowabu yari yambaye umwambaro wiwe w’intambara arenzako umukanda kw’itako ashirako n’inkota iri mu rwubati rwayo. Maze ariko aragenda kuramutsa Amasa amera nk’usokora inkota yiwe, iva mu rwubati.<verse eid="2SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Yowabu abwira Amasa ati: “Amakuru maki ga muvukanyi?” Nuko Yowabu afata Amasa ku bwanwa n’ukuboko kwiwe kw’i buryo aramugumbira. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Amasa ntiyari yabonye ko Yowabu yafatishije inkota ukuboko kw’i bubamfu, maze Yowabu aca ayimucumita mu nda amara yiwe aseseka hasi. Ubwo nyene Amasa aca aracikana, Yowabu atiriwe arongera kumucumita. Yowabu n’umuvukanyi wiwe Abishayi baca babandanya gukurikira Sheba mwene Bikuri.<verse eid="2SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Umwe nu ngabo zari kumwe na Yowabu ahagarara i ruhande ya Amasa abwira ingabo za Amasa ati: “Uwukunda Yowabu wese, uwuri ku ruhande rwa Dawidi wese, nakurikire Yowabu!” <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Amasa we yari arambaraye mu bitenga vy’amaraso yiwe mu nzira, maze wa muntu abonye ko ingabo zose zihagera zigahagarara, aca akwega umuvyimba awukura mu nzira awushira mu mirima awurenzako impuzu. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Amasa amaze gukurwa mu nzira, ingabo zose zijana na Yowabu bakurikira Sheba mwene Bikuri.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Sheba aca mu miryango y’Abisirayeli yose mbere ashika n’i Abeli-Beti-Mayaka no mu ntara yose y’Ababikiriti, baca barakorana bamuja inyuma. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Ingabo zose zari kumwe na Yowabu zishitse basugereza Sheba ari mu gisagara c’i Abeli-Beti-Mayaka. Baca barunda ikirundo c’ivu cegamiye ku ruhande rw’inyuma y’uruzitiro. Bakiriko barabomora urwo ruzitiro ngo barusenyure, <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />umugore umwe w’umunyabwenge ahamagara ari mu gisagara ati: “Umviriza! Umviriza! Mbwirira Yowabu aze hano ico ndamubwira.” <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Na we aja iyo ari, na we aramubaza ati: “Ni wewe Yowabu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Aramwishura ati: “Ni jewe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Wa mugore amubwira ati: “Umviriza ico umusavyikazi wawe ngomba kukubwira.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Amwishura ati: “Ndaguteze amatwi.”<verse eid="2SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Wa mugore arabandanya ati: “Kera bahora bavuga bati, ‘ugomba kumara ibihari, baza abo mu gisagara Abeli,’ kandi ni ko bakora. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Ndi umunyamahoro n’umwizigirwa muri Isirayeli. Ariko muriko mugerageza gusenyura igisagara gihambaye muri Isirayeli. None ni iki gituma mugomba kuyongobeza umugabane w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>?”<verse eid="2SA 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Yowabu aramwishura ati: “Ntibikabe ko norota nsambura igisagara canyu! <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Iyo si yo ntumbero. Umuntu yitwa Sheba mwene Bikuri, ava mu misozi y’Abefurayimu, yahagurukiye kugwanya umwami Dawidi. Nimuduhe uwo mugabo, natwe duca tuva muri iki gisagara.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:21">Wa mugore abwira Yowabu ati: “Umutwe wiwe barawuguterera bawucishije hejuru y’uruzitiro.”<verse eid="2SA 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Nuko wa mugore w’umunyabwenge aja ku bantu b’iwabo ajanye inama yiwe y’ubwenge, baca bafata Sheba mwene Bikuri bamuca umutwe bawuterera Yowabu. Nuko aca avuza inzamba, abantu biwe baca bava muri ico gisagara, umwe wese yitahira iwe. Yowabu na we aca asubira i bwami i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abishikira ba Dawidi</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Yowabu ni we yatwara ingabo zose z’Abisirayeli;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 20:23">Benaya mwene Yehoyada ni we yatwara Abakereti n’Abapeleti;<verse eid="2SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adoramu yari ajejwe abakozi bo ku bikebere;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 20:24">Yehoshafati mwene Ahiludi yari umwanditsi w’ivyaja biraba;<verse eid="2SA 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Sheva yari umwanditsi;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 20:25">Sadoki na Abiyatari bari abaherezi;<verse eid="2SA 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />maze Ira Umuyayiri na we yari umuherezi wa Dawidi.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Abo mu ruvyaro rwa Sawuli bicwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />Ku ngoma ya Dawidi, haba inzara imara imyaka itatu yikurikiranya; maze Dawidi arondera mu nyonga h’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuga ati: “Ni kubera Sawuli n’inzu yiwe basheshe amaraso, mu kwica Abagibeyoni.”<verse eid="2SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Umwami ahamagaza Abagibeyoni avugana na bo. (Abo Bagibeyoni ntibari Abisirayeli ariko bari amasigarira y’Abamori. Abisirayeli bari barabarahiye ko batazobica, ariko Sawuli kubera ishaka yari afitiye Abisirayeli n’Abayuda yagerageje kubahonya bose.) <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Dawidi abaza Abagibeyoni ati: “Nobakorera iki? Nokosora gute amakosa yakozwe kugira ngo muhezagire umugabane w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>?”<verse eid="2SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Abagibeyoni baramwishura bati: “Ifeza canke inzahabu ntizokuraho iyo ngorane hagati yacu n’umuryango wa Sawuli kandi nta burenganzira dufise bwo kwica umuntu n’umwe mu Bisirayeli.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:4">Dawidi arababaza ati: “None mugomba ko ndabakorera iki?”<verse eid="2SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Bishura umwami bati: “Sawuli yagomba kuduherengeteza ngo ntihasigare n’umwe kandi ntihabe hakiri ahantu na hamwe turangwa mu Bwisirayeli hose. <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />None duhe abagabo indwi bo mu bamukomokako, tubice tubarambike imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> i Gibeya h’i Sawuli, ku musozi watoranijwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:6">Nuko umwami aravuga ati: “Ndababaha.”<verse eid="2SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Umwami akingira Mefibosheti mwene Yonatani, Yonatani mwene Sawuli, ku bwa ya ndahiro Dawidi yarahira Yonatani imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Ariko umwami atanga abahungu babiri ba Sawuli ari bo Arumoni na Mefibosheti, yavyaranye na Rizipa umukobwa wa Ayiya hamwe n’abahungu batanu ba Merabu umukobwa wa Sawuli, abo yari yavyaranye na Adiriyeli mwene Baruzilayi Umumeholati. <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />Abaha Abagibeyoni, na bo barabica babarambika imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Abo uko bari indwi bapfira rimwe; bishwe mu misi ya mbere y’iyimbura, bagitangura kwimbura sayiri.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Rizipa umukobwa wa Ayiya afata amagunira ayubakamwo urusago ku gitandara. Kuva mu ntango z’ukwimbura gushika imvura ikorotse kuri ya mivyimba, ntiyemerera inyoni zo mu kirere kuyikorako ku murango canke ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba mw’ijoro. <verse eid="2SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Dawidi yumvise ivyo Rizipa umukobwa wa Ayiya akaba kandi incoreke ya Sawuli yakoze, <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />aragenda aja gusaba ab’i Yabeshi Gileyadi amagufa ya Sawuli na Yonatani. (Igihe Abafilisitiya bica Sawuli na Yonatani ku musozi Gilibowa, abantu b’i Yabeshi Gileyadi bagiye binyegeje bafata imivyimba yabo, bayikura ku mbuga y’ikoraniro i Beti-Shani aho Abafilisitiya babamanitse.) <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Dawidi akurayo amagufa ya Sawuli n’umuhungu wiwe Yonatani, hamwe n’aya ba bantu indwi bishwe kandi bakanikirwa n’Abagibeyoni.<verse eid="2SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />Bahamba ya magufa ya Sawuli n’umuhungu wiwe Yonatani mu mva ya Kishi se wa Sawuli, yari i Zela mu Bubenyamini, kandi bakora ivyo umwami yategetse vyose. Inyuma y’ivyo, Imana yishura amasengesho basengeye igihugu.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intambara zo kugwanya Abafilisitiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Haba iyindi ntambara hagati y’Abafilisitiya n’Abisirayeli. Dawidi amanukana n’abantu biwe kugwanya Abafilisitiya, maze araruha. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />Kandi Ishubi Benobi, umwe mu bo mu ruvyaro rwa Rafa, icumu ryiwe ryapima shekeli amajana atatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 3,5.</char></note> kandi yari yambaye inkota nshasha. Yari asugereje Dawidi agomba kumwica. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Ariko Abishayi mwene Zeruwiya aza gutabara Dawidi; yica uwo Mufilisitiya. Maze abantu ba Dawidi bararahira umwami, bavuga bati: “Ntuzosubira na rimwe kujana natwe mu ntambara, kugira ngo itara rya Isirayeli ntirizime.”<verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Hanyuma y’ivyo, haba iyindi ntambara n’Abafilisitiya ibera i Gobu. Muri ico gihe Sibekayi Umuhushati yica Safi, umwe wo mu ruvyaro rwa Rafa.<verse eid="2SA 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />Mu yindi ntambara yabereye i Gobu bagwanya Abafilisitiya, Eluhanani mwene Yayare-Oregimu w’i Betelehemu yica mwenewabo wa Goliyati w’i Gati, uruti rw’icumu ryiwe rwangana n’umuhini.<verse eid="2SA 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Kandi mu yindi ntambara yabereye i Gati, hari umugabo munini cane yari afise intoke zitandatu ku kiganza cose n’amano atandatu ku kirenge cose; vyose hamwe vyari mirongo ibiri na bine. Na we nyene yakomoka kuri Rafa. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Atanguye gucokora Abisirayeli, Yonatani mwene Shimeya, yavukana na Dawidi, aramwica.<verse eid="2SA 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Abo bose uko ari bane bakomoka kuri Rafa w’i Gati, maze bicwa na Dawidi n’abantu biwe.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi aririmba indirimbo y’ishimwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />Dawidi aririmbira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> muri aya majambo amaze kumukiza abansi biwe bose, no kumukura mu maboko ya Sawuli. <verse eid="2SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />Aravuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:2">“<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni igitandara canje, igihome canje kinkingira n’umutabazi wanje;<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />Imana yanje ni igitandara canje nihishamwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">inkinzo yanje n’ihembe ry’agakiza kanje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">Ni we buhungiro bwanje, ubwihisho bwanje n’umukiza wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">ankiza abantu b’inkozi z’ikibi.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />Nambaje <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, we abereye gushimwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:4">na we ankiza abansi banje.<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />Imipfunda y’urupfu yaransugereje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:5">imikuba y’ukurandura yarandengeye.<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />Iminyororo y’i kuzimu yaranyizingiriyeko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:6">imitego y’urupfu yarantangiriye.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />Mu mubabaro wanje nambaje <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">nambaje Imana yanje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">Iri mu ngoro yayo yumvise ijwi ryanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">ugutakamba kwanje gushika mu matwi yayo.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />Isi yaratigise ihinda agashitsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">amatanguriro y’amajuru aranyiganyiga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">yahinze agashitsi kuko Uhoraho yari yaratse.<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Umwotsi wapfunduka mu mazuru yiwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">umuriro utongora wava mu kanwa kiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">hamwe n’amakara yaka.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />Yamenye ijuru aramanuka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:10">ibicu vyirabura vyari musi y’ibirenge vyiwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Yaje aguruka ku mukerubi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:11">aboneka agendera ku mababa y’umuyaga.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />Yipfutse umwijima nk’ihema rimukikuje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:12">ibicu vyirabura vyo kw’ijuru vyuzuye imvura.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Mu gukayangana kwo mu nyonga hiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:13">havamwo imiravyo imeze nk’imbeya z’umuriro.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaraturagaye ari mw’ijuru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:14">ijwi ry’Iyisumbavyose ryarasamiranye.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />Yarashe imyampi isanzaza abansi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:15">imbeya z’umuriro zarabakinagije.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />Ibiyaya vyo mu kiyaga vyagiye ahabona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">n’amatanguriro y’isi aragaragara</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">ku bw’ugukankama kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">no ku bw’impwemu ziva mu mazuru yiwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />Yagoroye ukuboko kwiwe ari iyo hejuru aramfata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:17">ankura mu mazi menshi.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />Yantabaye umwansi wanje akomeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:18">ankiza abanyanka, bandusha inkomezi.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Banteye ku musi w’ivyago vyanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:19">ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we yanshigikiye.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />Yaransohoye anjana ahagutse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:20">arankiza kuko yanezererewe.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yankoreye ibihwanye n’ukugororoka kwanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:21">yampaye ingero ikwiranye n’ugutungana kw’amaboko yanje.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Kuko nagumye mu nzira z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:22">sinigeze ncumura ngo mve ku Mana yanje.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />Ivyagezwe vyiwe vyose biri imbere yanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:23">sinigeze mpindukira ngo mve mu vyo yihanikirije.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Namye ntagira umugayo imbere yiwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:24">kandi nirinze icaha.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yanyishuye ibikwiranye n’ukugororoka kwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:25">ibihwanye n’ugutungana kwanje mu nyonga hiwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />Ku mwizigirwa wiyerekana uri umwizigirwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:26">ku wutagira umugayo wiyerekana uri uwutagira umugayo,<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />ku wutunganye wiyerekana uri uwutunganye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:27">ariko ku muntu w’intabarirwa wiyerekana nk’uwutagira akagongwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Ukiza abaciye bugufi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:28">ariko inyonga zawe ziri ku bibone ngo ubacishe bugufi.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, uri itara ryanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:29">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahindura umwijima wanje ukaba umuco.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />Ku bwawe, nshobora gutera ingabo nyinshi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:30">turi kumwe n’Imana yanje, nshobora kwurira uruzitiro.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />Imana yo, inzira yayo iratunganye:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni iry’ukuri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">abera inkinzo abamuhungirako bose.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />None ni nde Mana atari <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:32">Kandi ni nde Gitandara atari Imana yacu?<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Imana ni yo buhungiro bwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:33">igorora inzira yanje.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />Ihindura ibirenge vyanje nk’ivy’impongo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:34">ikanshoboza guhagarara ku dutwe tw’imisozi.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />Yigisha iminwe yanje kugwana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:35">agashoboza amaboko yanje gufora umuheto w’umwakaka.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Agakiza kawe kabaye inkinzo yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:36">ubushobozi bwawe ni bwo bwangize uwuhambaye.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Wanteguriye inzira ncamwo yagutse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:37">kugira ngo ibirenge vyanje ntibinyerere.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />Nakurikiye abansi banje ndabanesha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:38">sinasubiye inyuma badaherengeteye.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Nabagize ubunywenywe, nta n’uwushobora kuvyura umutwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:39">baguye musi y’ibirenge vyanje.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Wanyambitse inkomezi zo kugwana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:40">wacishije bugufi abansi banje imbere yanje.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Watumye abansi banje bata barahunga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:41">kandi wampaye kubaherengeteza.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Baratakamvye, habura uwubakiza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:42">batakambiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ariko ntiyabishura.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Maze ndabasya nk’umukungugu wo hasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:43">ndabahonyanga, ndabasiribanga nk’ivyondo mu nzira y’abahita.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />Wankijije ibitero vy’abantu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:44">unzigamira ingoma ngo nganze amahanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:44">Abantu ntigeze kumenya ubu ni bo bankorera,<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />abanyamahanga baranyunamira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:45">uko bumvise ijwi ryanje, baranyumvira.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Bose bacika intege;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:46">bava aho bari binyegeje bahinda agashitsi.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni muzima! Hahimbazwe igitandara canje!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:47">Hashirwe hejuru Imana yo gitandara c’agakiza kanje!<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />Ni we Mana imporera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:48">igashira amahanga musi yanje,<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />ikankiza abansi banje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:49">Wanshize hejuru y’abangwanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:49">untabara abantu b’inkozi z’ikibi.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />Ni co gituma nzoguhimbaza, ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, mu mahanga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:50">nzotazira izina ryawe.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />Ni we aha umwami wiwe intsinzi zihambaye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">yerekanye urukundo rudashira ku wo yarobanuje amavuta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">ari we Dawidi n’uruvyaro rwiwe.”<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Amajambo ya nyuma ya Dawidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Aya ni yo majambo ya nyuma ya Dawidi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">“Uku ni ko Dawidi mwene Isayi avuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">uwashizwe hejuru n’Iyisumbavyose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">umuntu yasizwe amavuta n’Imana ya Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">umuririmvyi aririmba indirimbo ya Isirayeli.<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavugiye muri jewe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:2">ijambo ryiwe ryari ku rurimi rwanje.<verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Imana y’Abisirayeli yaravuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">gitandara c’Abisirayeli yarambwiye ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">‘Uwuganza abantu mu bugororotsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">igihe aganza yubaha Imana,<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />aba ameze nk’umuco wo mu gitondo igihe izuba riserutse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">mu gitondo kitagira ibicu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:4">nk’ugukayangana kw’ijuru inyuma y’imvura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">kumwe gutuma ivyatsi bimera biva mw’ivu.’<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />Mbega inzu yanje ntiri amahoro ku Mana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">Ntiyagiranye nanje isezerano rihoraho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">ryashizweho rigakomezwa impande zose?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">Mbega ntizoshitsa ivy’agakiza kanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">igashitsa n’ivyo nipfuza?<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Ariko abantu babi bazotabwa nk’amahwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:6">umuntu adashobora kwegeranya n’intoke gusa.<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />Uwukoze ku mahwa wese</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">akoresha icuma canke uruti rw’icumu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">maze agaturirirwa aho arunze.”<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abahizi ba Dawidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Aya ni yo mazina y’abahizi ba Dawidi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:8">Yoshebu Bashebeti, Umutakemoni, yari umukuru wa bamwe batatu; yatoye icumu agwanya abantu amajana umunani, maze bose abicira icarimwe.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Yakurikirwa na Eliyazeri mwene Dodayi Umwahohi, yari umwe muri bamwe batatu b’abahizi mu ntambara, yari kumwe na Dawidi igihe bahagarara imbere y’Abafilisitiya bari batonze urugamba i Pasi-Damimu. Maze ingabo z’Abisirayeli zirahunga, <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />ariko we ararinda agwanya Abafilisitiya gushika aho ukuboko kugwa ibinyanya ku buryo atari agishobora kubangura inkota. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atanga intsinzi ihambaye kuri uwo musi. Ingabo zahavuye zigaruka aho Eliyazeri ari, ariko bari baje gukoba imivyimba.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Uwa gatatu yari Shama mwene Ageyi Umuharari. Igihe Abafilisitiya bahurira hamwe mu murima wuzuye ibiharage, ingabo z’Abisirayeli zaciye zibahunga; <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />ariko Shama arabarinda ari hagati muri uwo murima. Arawugwanira maze yica Abafilisitiya, kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atanga intsinzi ikomeye.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Mu gihe c’iyimbura, batatu bo mu bahizi biwe mirongo itatu baramanuka basanga Dawidi aho yari ari mw’isenga ry’ibuye i Adulamu. Ico gihe umugwi w’Abafilisitiya wari ucumbitse mu kiyaya c’i Refayimu. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />Muri ico gihe Dawidi yari mu kinyegero, kandi umuce w’ingabo z’Abafilisitiya wari i Betelehemu. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Dawidi yumva agomba amazi, maze aca avuga ati: “Ese icompa hakagira uwunzanira amazi yo kunywa yo kw’iriba riri kw’irembo ry’i Betelehemu!” <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Nuko ba bahizi batatu baragenda, baca hagati y’ingabo z’Abafilisitiya, bavoma ayo mazi yo kw’iriba ryari hafi y’irembo ry’i Betelehemu bayashira Dawidi. Ariko Dawidi yanka kuyanywa; ayasesa hasi imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />Avuga ati: “Ntibikabe, ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ko nokora ivyo! Nokwubahuka kunywa amaraso y’aba bantu bahevye amagara yabo?” Dawidi ntiyemera kuyanywa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:17">Ivyo ni vyo vy’ubuhizi abo bagabo batatu bakoze.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Abishayi mwene nyina wa Yowabu mwene Zeruwiya yari umukuru w’abo batatu. Yishe abantu amajana atatu akoresheje icumu ryiwe, bituma aba rurangiranwa nka bamwe batatu. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Mbega ntiyabaye uw’icubahiro kurusha abo batatu? Mbere yabaye umutware wabo, naho atashizwe mu gitigiri cabo.<verse eid="2SA 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Benaya mwene Yehoyada yari umugwanyi w’umuhizi yava i Kabuzeyeli, kandi yakoze ibihambaye. Yishe abahizi babiri baruta abandi mu ngabo z’Abanyamowabu. Umusi umwe shelegi iriko iragwa, amanuka mu rwobo, yica intambwe. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Ni we yishe Umunyegiputa w’ikigatanya. Naho uwo Munyegiputa yari afise icumu mu minwe, Benaya yagiye kumugwanya afise inkoni, amushikura rya cumu mu minwe, aba ari ryo amwicisha. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Ivyo ni vyo bikorwa vy’ubuhizi Benaya mwene Yehoyada yakoze; na we nyene yari rurangiranwa nka bamwe batatu. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Yari afise icubahiro kuruta bamwe mirongo itatu, ariko ntiyari uwo muri bamwe batatu. Maze Dawidi aca amugira umukuru w’abacungera umutekano wiwe.<verse eid="2SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Muri abo mirongo itatu harimwo:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:24">Asaheli yavukana na Yowabu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:24">Eluhanani mwene Dodo w’i Betelehemu,<verse eid="2SA 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />Shama w’i Harodi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:25">Elika w’i Harodi,<verse eid="2SA 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />Helezi w’i Paluti,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:26">Ira mwene Ikeshi w’i Tekowa,<verse eid="2SA 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />Abiyezeri w’i Anatoti,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:27">Mebunayi Umuhushati,<verse eid="2SA 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />Zalumoni w’Umwahohi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:28">Maharayi w’i Netofati<verse eid="2SA 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />Heledi mwene Bayana w’i Netofati,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:29">Itayi mwene Ribayi w’i Gibeya mu Bubenyamini,<verse eid="2SA 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />Benaya w’i Piratoni,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:30">Hidayi wo mu bihomoka vy’i Gayashi,<verse eid="2SA 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />Abi-Aluboni Umwarubati,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:31">Azumaveti Umubahurimu,<verse eid="2SA 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />Eliyaba Umushaluboni,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:32">Bene Yasheni,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:32">Yonatani <verse eid="2SA 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />mwene Shama Umuharari,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:33">Ahiyamu mwene Sharari Umuharari,<verse eid="2SA 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />Elifeleti mwene Ahasubayi w’i Mayaka,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:34">Eliyamu mwene Ahitofeli w’i Giloni,<verse eid="2SA 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />Heziro w’i Karumeli,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:35">Payari w’i Arubi,<verse eid="2SA 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />Igali mwene Natani w’i Zoba,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:36">Bani w’i Gadi,<verse eid="2SA 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />Zeleki Umwamoni,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:37">Naharayi Umuberoti, uwatwaza Yowabu mwene Zeruwiya ibigwanisho,<verse eid="2SA 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />Ira w’i Ituri,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:38">Garebu w’i Ituri<verse eid="2SA 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />na Uriya Umuheti.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 23:39" />
  <para style="lf" vid="2SA 23:39">Bose hamwe bari mirongo itatu n’indwi.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi aharura ingabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />Maze uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bwongera kuziriringira Abisirayeli, aca atera Dawidi agatima ko kubaharura kugira ngo abakwegere ivyago, avuga ati: “Genda uharure Abisirayeli n’Abayuda.”<verse eid="2SA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Nuko umwami abwira Yowabu n’intwazangabo bari kumwe na we ati: “Nimukwiragire mu miryango yose y’Abisirayeli kuva i Dani gushika i Berisheba muharure abazi kugwana, kugira ngo menye uko bangana.”<verse eid="2SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Ariko Yowabu yishura umwami ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe arakagwiza ingabo incuro ijana, kandi inyonga z’umwami wanje zize zibibone. Ariko ni kubera iki umwami wanje ashaka gukora ikintu nk’ico?”<verse eid="2SA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Ariko ijambo ry’umwami rirengera irya Yowabu, maze Yowabu n’intwazangabo bava imbere y’umwami, baja guharura ingabo z’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="2SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Bamaze kujabuka Yorodani, bacumbika i ruhande ya Aroweri, mu bumanuko bw’igisagara mu kabande, hanyuma baca mu ntara ya Gadi n’i Yazeri. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Baja i Gileyadi n’i Kadeshi mu ntara y’i Tahutimu Hodushi, bashishikara baja i Dani Yani berekeye i Sidoni. <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />Maze baca baja ku ruzitiro rw’i Tiro no mu bisagara vy’Abahiwi n’Abanyakanani. Barangije baja i Berisheba n’i Negebu i Buyuda.<verse eid="2SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Bamaze kunyuragira mu gihugu cose, bagaruka i Yerusalemu haheze amezi icenda n’imisi mirongo ibiri.<verse eid="2SA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Yowabu ashikiriza umwami igitigiri c’abantu baja ku rugamba. Muri Isirayeli hari ibihumbi amajana umunani b’abahizi bazi kugwanisha inkota, mu Buyuda na ho ibihumbi amajana atanu.<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Dawidi amaze guharura ingabo, umutima utangura kumurega, maze abwira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati: “Nacumuye cane kuko nakoze ivyo. None rero, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ndakwinginze, unkureko icaha canje jewe umusavyi wawe. Nakoze ivy’ubupfu.”<verse eid="2SA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Dawidi avyutse mu gitondo ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> riza kuri Gadi uwavugishwa na we akaba n’uwerekwa wa Dawidi ati: <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />“Genda ubwire Dawidi uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Ndaguhaye ibintu bitatu. Hitamwo kimwe nzoguhanisha.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Nuko Gadi aja kwa Dawidi aramubwira ati: “Mbega yoguteza imyaka itatu y’inzara mu gihugu cawe, canke amezi atatu yo guhunga abansi banyu bariko barabakinagiza, canke imisi itatu y’ikiza mu gihugu canyu? Nuko rero nuvyiyumvireko, uhitemwo hanyuma umbwire, kugira ngo ngire ico nishura uwantumye.”<verse eid="2SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Dawidi abwira Gadi ati: “Ndi n’umubabaro mwinshi. Reka tugwe mu maboko y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kuko imbabazi ziwe ari nyinshi; ariko singwe mu maboko y’abantu.”<verse eid="2SA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arungika ikiza mu Bisirayeli guhera muri ico gitondo gushika ico gihe cashinzwe giheze, maze hapfa abantu ibihumbi mirongo indwi kuva i Dani gushika i Berisheba. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Umumarayika agoroye ukuboko kwiwe ngo arandure Yerusalemu, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ababazwa n’ico cago aca abwira uwo mumarayika yariko aratikiza abantu ati: “Geza aho! Garukana ukuboko kwawe!” Umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> muri ico gihe yari ku mbuga yo kugosorerako ingano ya Arawuna Umuyebusi.<verse eid="2SA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Dawidi abonye umumarayika yariko arica abantu, abwira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati: “Ni jewe nacumuye nkora icaha. Aba bantu bo ni nk’intama. None bakoze iki? Ukuboko kwawe niguhane jewe n’umuryango wanje.”<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawidi yubaka igicaniro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />Kuri uwo musi Gadi aja kwa Dawidi aramubwira ati: “Duga wubakire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> igicaniro ku mbuga yo kugosorerako ingano ya Arawuna Umuyebusi.” <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Nuko Dawidi araduga, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yamutegetse biciye kuri Gadi. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Maze Arawuna yunamuye amaso abona umwami n’abantu biwe baza aho ari, aca arunama imbere y’umwami, ashika hasi.<verse eid="2SA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Maze Arawuna avuga ati: “Ni iki kizanye umwami wanje ku musavyi wiwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">Dawidi amwishura ati: “Nzanywe no kugura imbuga yawe, kugira ngo ndahubakire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> igicaniro, kugira ngo ikiza kiri mu bantu gihagarare.”<verse eid="2SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Arawuna abwira Dawidi ati: “Umwami wanje niyakire ico yipfuza cose gushikana. Ng’izi n’impfizi z’ikimazi co guturirwa n’umuriro, kandi ehe n’imihini yo gusekura hamwe n’ingogo ndabitanze ngo bibe inkwi, <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />vyose ndabiguhaye, mwami.” Arawuna yongera abwira umwami ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yemere kwakira ikimazi cawe.”<verse eid="2SA 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Ariko umwami yishura Arawuna ati: “Oya, ndakwinginze unyemerere ndakurihe. Sinshobora gushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanje ikimazi ata co ndakiguze.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:24">Nuko Dawidi agura iyo mbuga n’izo nka atanga, shekeli mirongo itanu z’ifeza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 575.</char></note>. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Dawidi yubakira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> igicaniro aca atanga ibimazi vyo guturirwa n’ivy’ishimwe. Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yishura isengesho ryiwe, ikiza kiva mu Bisirayeli.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>